WEBVTT

00:27.937 --> 00:29.812
Rice cake for sale.

00:29.854 --> 00:32.062
Grilled potatoes for sale.

00:33.727 --> 00:35.851
Rice cake for sale.

00:35.876 --> 00:38.117
Grilled potatoes for sale.

00:41.810 --> 00:43.227
Here are your luggages.

00:44.412 --> 00:46.787
- What's your name?
- Oh, thank you.

00:46.812 --> 00:48.336
Wouldn't even answer me.

00:51.646 --> 00:52.896
No manners at all.

00:56.229 --> 00:57.687
Black coffee, no sugar please.

01:01.604 --> 01:02.979
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

01:06.506 --> 01:08.190
- Here.
- Thank you.

01:26.229 --> 01:27.437
Babe, where are you going?

02:41.729 --> 02:43.354
Hey, you dropped something.

02:43.896 --> 02:45.396
Here, let me help.

02:46.146 --> 02:47.271
Thank you.

02:47.312 --> 02:49.388
- You good? I can help.
- I'm okay.

02:58.437 --> 02:59.437
How nice of you!

02:59.687 --> 03:02.312
- I was just helping her.
- Help with the laundry in the house.

03:02.312 --> 03:04.521
I'm on my way, stop pushing me.

03:04.804 --> 03:07.888
You never listen to me!
Why do you keep running around?

03:08.021 --> 03:09.354
Shut up, get out of the house.

03:09.396 --> 03:11.896
- Here we go again!
- Get out, don't ever come back here.

03:12.146 --> 03:13.312
Be quiet!

03:13.437 --> 03:16.187
- Why are you crying?
- How can you play like that?

03:16.229 --> 03:18.396
- Stop crying.
- So stupid.

03:18.437 --> 03:21.187
Why wouldn't you listen to me?
So stupid.

03:21.187 --> 03:22.271
Damn it!

03:22.271 --> 03:24.354
- Damn, that hurts.
- I'm sorry.

03:24.396 --> 03:26.187
That freaking hurt, bitch.

03:26.187 --> 03:28.187
- I didn't mean to.
- Look where you're going.

03:28.437 --> 03:29.771
My gosh!

03:29.771 --> 03:32.437
- How dare you look at me?
- Sorry.

03:35.937 --> 03:37.229
Oh my, Puppy!

03:37.271 --> 03:38.646
- Where's the puppy?
- Puppy!

03:38.771 --> 03:40.104
- Oh, here it is.
- That fish?

03:40.146 --> 03:41.396
It's okay, it's okay.

03:41.396 --> 03:42.646
Oh, you're okay.

03:42.854 --> 03:43.979
Puppy!

03:44.062 --> 03:45.354
Come on, come on.

03:47.687 --> 03:48.687
Is it okay?

03:50.771 --> 03:52.562
Thank God he's okay.

03:53.021 --> 03:54.062
Thanks.

03:54.562 --> 03:56.062
A fish named Puppy?

03:57.562 --> 03:58.771
What about the doggy mommy?

03:59.562 --> 04:01.104
Just leave this here.

04:01.146 --> 04:03.354
- Gotta get home first then I'll clean.
- It's okay, I'll clean it.

04:03.396 --> 04:04.771
You live up there?

04:05.271 --> 04:06.812
- Give them to me.
- I got it.

04:08.771 --> 04:10.021
- Thank you.
- It's okay.

04:10.479 --> 04:11.687
Right over here.

04:16.104 --> 04:17.187
You good?

04:20.979 --> 04:22.021
Thanks.

04:22.812 --> 04:24.521
- I'm here.
- Mai.

04:24.646 --> 04:25.979
- There you are.
- Yeah.

04:26.104 --> 04:27.854
I've been cleaning up for you.

04:27.937 --> 04:30.312
You can just unpack and it's all done.

04:30.604 --> 04:31.979
Everything's good?

04:33.562 --> 04:36.354
So close to work, and in district 1 too,

04:36.646 --> 04:38.687
my price is unbeatable.

04:39.812 --> 04:41.062
I don't have much,

04:41.146 --> 04:43.062
just several aparments in this building.

04:43.854 --> 04:45.812
The neighbors here are super nice.

04:45.937 --> 04:49.437
If you don't like this one, let me know,
I'll switch you to a different unit.

04:49.604 --> 04:51.646
I don't think you'd need to change though.

04:51.687 --> 04:53.187
This is the newest one.

04:54.354 --> 04:55.604
Oh my!

04:55.646 --> 04:57.812
What a terrible job they did!

04:57.812 --> 05:00.021
- Just leave it, it's okay.
- So mad!

05:00.021 --> 05:02.604
Just leave it, I'll have my guys come
fix it for you.

05:03.062 --> 05:05.354
Open the boxes, I'll help you unpack.

05:05.354 --> 05:06.812
Come on, open them up.

05:06.854 --> 05:08.437
Here, give that to me.

05:08.479 --> 05:10.271
Give it to me, I'll put it up here.

05:12.396 --> 05:15.437
Damn, it's the same guys. It's them.

05:15.687 --> 05:18.104
Don't worry, I'll have them come
fix it tomorrow.

05:18.521 --> 05:20.187
- Unpack yourself! It's better!
- Okay.

05:21.312 --> 05:22.896
Welcome to the building.

05:23.271 --> 05:24.896
Two months rent, please.

05:25.354 --> 05:26.396
Okay.

05:31.604 --> 05:33.396
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

05:34.521 --> 05:35.646
Any tip?

05:39.812 --> 05:42.062
- Here, have a drink on me.
- Thank you.

05:43.437 --> 05:44.729
Single or married, Mai?

05:46.062 --> 05:47.229
I said are you married?

05:47.521 --> 05:50.396
- I need to unpack.
- Just unpack, I'm just asking.

05:50.562 --> 05:52.062
I can't, actually.

05:52.354 --> 05:54.021
Oh, okay, I'll head out then.

05:56.271 --> 05:58.729
Oh, how much do you make a month?

06:01.562 --> 06:03.271
Okay okay. Have a pleasant time!

06:04.604 --> 06:05.812
Good night.

06:08.021 --> 06:09.229
She's a sugar baby for sure.

06:09.229 --> 06:10.437
How do you know?

06:10.521 --> 06:12.312
Cash! It's all cash!

06:12.521 --> 06:13.687
I don't think so.

06:13.729 --> 06:15.979
- She's a whore for sure.
- Really?

06:16.104 --> 06:18.187
Would you look at that?
The sleek eyebrows!

06:18.229 --> 06:19.604
My experience.

06:19.812 --> 06:21.354
Hey sis, so are your eyebrows!

06:21.396 --> 06:22.812
You know what you're saying, bitch?

06:23.229 --> 06:24.937
Such nosy neighbors!

06:25.062 --> 06:26.729
Actually, who is her sugar daddy?

06:26.771 --> 06:28.562
- Watch your child!
- Hurry up kid.

06:28.604 --> 06:30.812
Tell me, I'm sure you know,
you've been talking to her for so long.

06:30.854 --> 06:33.271
- How would I know?
- Come on, you should've asked.

06:33.312 --> 06:35.062
- She's a new one.
- Of course another Duong's girl.

06:35.229 --> 06:37.187
How come he has so many girls?

06:38.771 --> 06:40.812
Of course, he's handsome, bitch!

07:49.729 --> 07:51.729
- Hello honey.
- Hello sweetie.

07:51.812 --> 07:52.896
I miss you.

07:52.896 --> 07:54.521
How's the new place?
Done unpacking?

07:55.021 --> 07:57.354
Yeah, just finished cleaning too.

07:57.354 --> 07:59.771
- How are the neighbors?
- Can't tell yet.

08:00.062 --> 08:01.354
A little loud though.

08:01.854 --> 08:03.521
It'll take a while to know.

08:03.854 --> 08:05.312
Can I stay with you tonight?

08:05.812 --> 08:07.521
- Please!
- I have work tomorrow.

08:08.312 --> 08:09.687
Come on!

08:10.562 --> 08:11.646
Wrong house?

08:12.646 --> 08:13.771
Delicious body!

08:14.146 --> 08:15.229
Go home.

08:17.521 --> 08:18.687
It's pretty nice here.

08:19.396 --> 08:21.312
Show me around.

08:21.312 --> 08:22.896
Okay, I'll switch the camera.

08:28.604 --> 08:29.771
I'll call you later.

08:31.146 --> 08:32.229
What's your name?

08:32.812 --> 08:34.312
You haven't told me yet.

08:34.937 --> 08:36.062
Goodnight.

08:44.187 --> 08:45.312
Hey!

09:00.729 --> 09:02.062
Oh my gosh!

09:02.479 --> 09:07.312
You've only been here for two weeks
but look at this Mai, Mai, Mai.

09:07.521 --> 09:08.937
Beginner's luck!

09:08.962 --> 09:12.504
Can you pretend to be a little worse
so the rest of us can make a living?

09:13.034 --> 09:14.037
Hey.

09:14.062 --> 09:15.101
Where's Mai?

09:15.354 --> 09:16.863
My friend is getting cooked in the sauna.

09:16.888 --> 09:18.429
Oh, we can start on him now.

09:18.657 --> 09:21.865
This is his first time here,
don't embarrass me.

09:21.890 --> 09:24.762
Don't worry. Trust me. I'm Tu.

09:25.272 --> 09:28.077
It's wet over here, wipe it down please.

09:28.302 --> 09:30.137
- Mr. Binh!
- Is Mai available?

09:30.162 --> 09:32.246
She just got booked.

09:32.271 --> 09:34.998
Head to the sauna,
I'll get someone else for you.

09:35.023 --> 09:36.565
You can count on Tu.

09:38.521 --> 09:41.021
Mr. Diep, Mr. Vinh, hello!

09:41.312 --> 09:44.146
Stop looking at your phone,
take care of them or I'll kill you.

09:45.062 --> 09:47.854
It's good to have so many bookings
as a newcomer.

09:49.646 --> 09:51.312
You are...

09:52.396 --> 09:54.854
This is Trinh, the Golden Hand here.

09:55.396 --> 09:56.229
Hello.

09:56.271 --> 09:58.187
This is Mai, we're from the same hometown.

09:58.271 --> 09:59.937
She's so good.

10:00.062 --> 10:02.021
The Golden Hand at the other branch.

10:02.062 --> 10:05.812
That's why the boss moved her here
to attract more customers.

10:07.062 --> 10:09.479
Work hard so you can be
the Golden Hand here as well.

10:09.521 --> 10:10.687
That'd be so good.

10:15.187 --> 10:17.979
I was out for two weeks because of Covid,
so we're only meeting now.

10:18.229 --> 10:21.729
I see. I'm new, please support me.
I gotta go now.

10:22.521 --> 10:23.896
- Mai!
- Yes?

10:24.937 --> 10:27.146
Let's trade moves some day.

10:27.271 --> 10:28.812
Show me your amazing skills.

10:29.354 --> 10:32.437
You're more experienced for sure.
I'll see you around.

10:38.312 --> 10:39.396
Trinh

10:40.479 --> 10:41.562
Have you recovered?

10:42.312 --> 10:44.437
Learn to think... before you speak.

10:46.146 --> 10:47.312
Oh, I gotta go.

11:43.771 --> 11:45.687
- Why did you hit me?
- I didn't mean to.

11:45.979 --> 11:48.229
- The oil...
- It does hurt.

11:48.646 --> 11:50.937
Sorry, relax, relax.

11:50.979 --> 11:52.604
I'll continue.

11:59.812 --> 12:00.937
Sorry baby.

12:00.979 --> 12:02.229
My stomach is a little upset.

12:03.271 --> 12:04.562
Sorry, I didn't mean to.

12:06.354 --> 12:08.021
I'll tip you more.

12:13.267 --> 12:16.835
I think you should go to the restroom.
I can wait.

12:17.396 --> 12:18.937
Give me five minutes then.

12:19.042 --> 12:19.829
Yes.

12:19.854 --> 12:21.660
What's wrong with me?

12:30.146 --> 12:31.271
Turn around please.

12:42.271 --> 12:43.562
Oh, so you work here.

12:45.396 --> 12:46.729
Why did you avoid me

12:46.729 --> 12:48.604
just to meet me here?

12:50.312 --> 12:52.021
Welcome then, neighbor.

12:52.479 --> 12:54.104
Lay down please, so I can continue.

12:54.146 --> 12:55.312
Give me your name then.

12:55.937 --> 12:58.604
You'll see my name on the tip paper.

13:00.896 --> 13:02.187
What do you think you're doing?

13:03.312 --> 13:05.521
I'm just pointing at your name tag.

13:07.437 --> 13:08.854
Your name's Mai,

13:08.937 --> 13:10.396
but my name's Duong.

13:10.687 --> 13:13.729
- Hello.
- Lay down, Duong, time's almost over.

13:13.854 --> 13:15.021
Okay Mai.

13:16.229 --> 13:17.437
What do you mean?

13:18.021 --> 13:19.396
Leaving space for you.

13:20.771 --> 13:22.604
Do you talk to all girls like that?

13:22.646 --> 13:23.771
Not really.

13:23.771 --> 13:24.979
Only to pretty girls.

13:25.187 --> 13:26.937
I'll consider that a compliment.

13:28.354 --> 13:30.562
Just tell me where you're hurt
and I'll work on that.

13:31.104 --> 13:32.479
It kinda hurts here.

13:33.021 --> 13:34.354
Chest massage then?

13:34.396 --> 13:35.646
Who'd call it that?

13:36.146 --> 13:37.604
It's a heart massage.

13:38.354 --> 13:39.729
My heart is broken, ah!

13:40.437 --> 13:41.896
So cheeky.

13:41.896 --> 13:44.146
Relax Bobby, relax.

13:47.271 --> 13:48.812
Are you massaging or fighting me?

13:49.562 --> 13:50.646
Get me someone else.

13:50.729 --> 13:52.937
I'll do something else.

13:52.979 --> 13:54.396
I've experienced enough.

13:54.437 --> 13:55.521
Get someone else.

13:56.562 --> 13:58.479
How can a massage feel like a fight?

13:59.687 --> 14:01.229
I'll work on your hand.

14:10.354 --> 14:11.604
What?

14:14.604 --> 14:15.729
You're beautiful.

14:16.062 --> 14:17.104
I know.

14:18.021 --> 14:20.312
This hand needs a special treatment.

14:20.979 --> 14:22.854
Ouch ouch, that hurts.

14:22.854 --> 14:24.562
It's okay, it'll feel good later.

14:24.604 --> 14:27.562
Can we get to the good bit
and skip this pain bit?

14:30.312 --> 14:31.854
My upper body is a little sensitive.

14:32.146 --> 14:33.479
Can you move lower?

14:34.104 --> 14:35.146
Okay.

14:52.271 --> 14:53.646
Oh oh, I'm done, I'm done.

15:01.562 --> 15:02.354
What now?

15:02.396 --> 15:04.812
My feet were injured from carrying
the suitcases.

15:04.812 --> 15:07.229
- Why didn't you tell me?
- I can only tell when you press on them.

15:07.271 --> 15:09.604
I'll wrap up then.

15:09.937 --> 15:11.437
I didn't mean you move that low.

15:11.479 --> 15:13.271
Get a little higher.

15:14.562 --> 15:15.812
You know what I mean?

15:17.146 --> 15:18.271
- Got it.
- Okay.

15:29.937 --> 15:31.021
What are you doing?

15:31.104 --> 15:32.396
You told me to move higher.

15:32.437 --> 15:33.937
Is this high enough?

15:34.062 --> 15:35.396
Are you trying to play dumb?

15:37.854 --> 15:39.062
Hey there,

15:39.062 --> 15:40.521
we give healthy massages here,

15:40.562 --> 15:42.771
if you're expecting something else,
go somewhere else.

15:43.062 --> 15:44.354
Show some respect.

15:47.896 --> 15:49.062
I'm sorry.

15:50.187 --> 15:51.979
- Let's call it for today.
- Okay.

15:54.021 --> 15:56.354
- Thank you.
- I'm really sorry.

15:56.354 --> 15:57.896
You seem nice,

15:58.229 --> 16:00.646
so I took it a little too far.

16:00.646 --> 16:02.021
Please forgive me.

16:02.021 --> 16:03.854
- It's okay.
- Hey

16:04.396 --> 16:06.646
We're neighbors after all,

16:06.896 --> 16:08.937
and somehow I get
injured everytime I see you.

16:08.979 --> 16:10.312
Are you making it up to me?

16:11.229 --> 16:12.396
Sure.

16:17.687 --> 16:18.937
No tip this time.

16:19.646 --> 16:23.229
But if you like my service, please give me
a five star rating. Thank you very much.

16:23.521 --> 16:24.812
Hope to see you again.

16:38.354 --> 16:39.479
Satisfied?

16:40.687 --> 16:42.729
How was your first time here?

16:43.187 --> 16:44.312
Mai is not bad, is she?

16:44.312 --> 16:46.187
- What are you doing?
- Cooling you down.

16:46.229 --> 16:47.646
Actually you're heating me up.

16:47.937 --> 16:50.271
Please don't. Let's cool down
with some hot ginger tea.

16:51.187 --> 16:52.396
How do you feel?

16:54.521 --> 16:55.604
Not bad.

16:56.687 --> 16:58.187
She's untouchable.

16:59.771 --> 17:01.062
No one can hit on her.

17:01.771 --> 17:03.687
She's just a massage girl.

17:04.604 --> 17:07.604
Well you can try, and she'll hit you back.
Learnt that the hard way.

17:07.646 --> 17:09.021
That's you.

17:11.854 --> 17:13.062
Duong.

17:13.062 --> 17:15.229
I know you're a lady killer,

17:15.437 --> 17:17.437
but if you can get with her,
I'll call you daddy.

17:18.062 --> 17:19.729
Hello dear son.

17:22.896 --> 17:24.437
I know you love coffee...

17:25.146 --> 17:26.937
Mai, it's me.

17:27.937 --> 17:29.104
It's me.

17:30.896 --> 17:32.021
It's me again.

17:33.729 --> 17:36.104
Hey miss neighbor, going for breakfast?

17:37.271 --> 17:38.312
I got this for you.

17:38.812 --> 17:41.229
- Breakfast?
- Thanks, I'm meeting someone.

17:45.812 --> 17:47.937
Don't worry.
My place, I'll take care of you.

17:50.479 --> 17:52.312
Ms. Lucy! Why didn't you call me first?

17:52.396 --> 17:53.646
Get her a table, idiots!

17:58.562 --> 18:00.854
Stop with the moaning or they'll think
I'm doing things to you.

18:01.729 --> 18:04.896
- I hate your moans.
- I just can't help it!

18:04.979 --> 18:06.187
Up to you.

18:06.229 --> 18:07.396
My gosh, I'm sorry!

18:07.729 --> 18:08.979
For you this week bro.

18:09.062 --> 18:10.604
- Some extra tip for you.
- Thank you.

18:10.646 --> 18:12.562
- Thank you.
- See you!

18:13.312 --> 18:15.146
How can you sleep
drinking coffee this late?

18:15.146 --> 18:16.771
Wanna have a chat?

18:16.771 --> 18:18.562
No, I need a rest, bye.

18:32.021 --> 18:33.104
It's not me.

18:33.896 --> 18:35.687
No, I just want to assure her.

18:35.687 --> 18:36.771
Who cares?

18:37.354 --> 18:39.562
Lemme know if the neighbors bully you.

18:39.604 --> 18:40.937
Ready to come down?

18:42.104 --> 18:43.479
Can you check my back?

18:44.229 --> 18:45.687
Need some special treatment again?

18:45.729 --> 18:46.812
Naughty hand!

18:47.146 --> 18:48.479
- Hands on your shoulders.
- Here?

18:48.521 --> 18:50.396
That's right. Bend your legs.

18:50.396 --> 18:51.521
Legs are bent.

18:52.021 --> 18:53.896
- What are you doing?
- I'm doing what you tell me to.

18:53.937 --> 18:55.062
Come on!

18:56.187 --> 18:57.854
Stop leaving trash in front of my house.

19:00.521 --> 19:04.354
It's not me. Someone put them here,
I'm just tidying it up.

19:04.479 --> 19:07.104
- No, it was you, mommy.
- Hey, don't say that.

19:07.312 --> 19:08.687
She doesn't know what she's saying.

19:08.729 --> 19:10.646
It's only a few steps from the
designated area.

19:10.729 --> 19:11.937
We're all adults here.

19:11.979 --> 19:13.979
What a big misunderstanding!

19:14.021 --> 19:16.729
It's not that I don't want to pay for trash
that I put them here. I just...

19:16.729 --> 19:18.227
What's going on?

19:18.271 --> 19:21.079
She thinks I leave trash in front of
her house to avoid paying for it.

19:21.104 --> 19:22.521
How could you?

19:22.562 --> 19:24.604
And stop letting your dog poop
in front of my house as well.

19:24.646 --> 19:27.104
Hey, did you see it?

19:27.146 --> 19:29.062
Don't accuse me if you didn't see it.

19:29.104 --> 19:30.812
You're the only one with a dog
on this floor.

19:30.854 --> 19:31.937
That's right.

19:32.187 --> 19:34.896
Hey bitch, I'm not the only one with a dog.

19:34.937 --> 19:36.979
There are lots of dogs on lots of floors.

19:37.062 --> 19:38.812
You think they'd climb the stairs
just to poop?

19:38.854 --> 19:41.021
So what do you mean?

19:41.021 --> 19:42.647
You wanna cause troubles?

19:42.672 --> 19:45.339
- It's her... who brings the troubles from the start.
- You scared me.

19:45.380 --> 19:48.605
There's been all the troubles ever since
she moved here.

19:48.630 --> 19:50.080
Let me tell you.

19:50.105 --> 19:53.897
She said my dog poops in front of her house
even though she never saw it.

19:53.922 --> 19:56.380
Not only your dog,
she even seduces my husband.

19:56.797 --> 19:58.630
- Isn't that scary?
- Fine, fine.

19:58.781 --> 20:00.894
- It's my fault. I'm sorry.
- Obviously.

20:01.627 --> 20:02.710
I'll just clean it.

20:02.947 --> 20:04.697
She apologized. Let's go.

20:04.722 --> 20:07.097
- Ten year time is not that long.
- I could lose my husband in a year.

20:07.122 --> 20:08.913
- We're all neighbors after all.
- Did you hear what she said?

20:08.938 --> 20:10.022
These dogs...

20:10.047 --> 20:12.172
Hey, who's the dog?

20:12.547 --> 20:13.499
That's me.

20:14.422 --> 20:15.547
The dog is here.

20:15.733 --> 20:16.453
Calm down.

20:17.099 --> 20:18.224
Coming.

20:18.263 --> 20:19.305
Almost there.

20:19.330 --> 20:20.599
She called for me.

20:21.031 --> 20:22.239
I'm the dog.

20:23.195 --> 20:24.278
Ms. Nga.

20:24.303 --> 20:26.665
You're much prettier than a dog.

20:27.195 --> 20:29.207
Go your way sis Phung, so nosy.

20:29.232 --> 20:30.428
I'm not free, I've got stuff to do.

20:30.453 --> 20:32.218
It's a good thing you're handsome.

20:32.367 --> 20:33.409
Let's go home.

20:33.442 --> 20:35.730
I'm not going home. Gotta go get food.

20:35.755 --> 20:37.172
Damn you.

20:37.214 --> 20:39.464
Home time. Let's go kid.

20:39.547 --> 20:41.089
- It's not me.
- She's starving.

20:41.089 --> 20:42.047
- Tell her.
- Okay.

20:42.089 --> 20:43.547
- It's not me.
- You're a good person.

20:43.589 --> 20:44.630
- Tell her.
- Got it.

20:44.630 --> 20:46.422
Why do you need to tell her?
Just let her be.

20:49.422 --> 20:50.589
I'll clean it later.

20:51.297 --> 20:53.922
- It's okay.
- Just leave it. I'll clean it.

20:54.922 --> 20:55.964
Come on.

20:59.547 --> 21:01.839
The hunter just saved the sheep
from the wolves.

21:02.630 --> 21:04.172
He deserves a drink inside.

21:04.964 --> 21:06.547
Hey, I'm late for work.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.964
I'm thankful but no time for any drink.

21:11.297 --> 21:12.839
Hey miss neighbor.

21:14.047 --> 21:15.255
A new fish tank.

21:17.130 --> 21:18.255
Kitty.

21:19.464 --> 21:21.047
Puppy needs a f...

21:21.589 --> 21:22.672
friend.

21:23.755 --> 21:24.880
Take them.

21:26.005 --> 21:27.089
Please.

21:29.047 --> 21:30.255
You pretty doggy mommy,

21:31.505 --> 21:33.339
Kitty really wants to meet Puppy,

21:33.755 --> 21:36.089
Kitty's lonely, Kitty is Puppy's ex...

21:36.089 --> 21:37.255
Fine, fine.

21:37.797 --> 21:38.964
Thank you.

21:39.422 --> 21:41.047
What a silly story!

21:43.922 --> 21:45.630
You have to let me take you to work.

21:46.505 --> 21:47.880
I just helped you.

21:48.089 --> 21:49.214
You can't say no.

21:55.380 --> 21:56.714
Thank you.

21:57.297 --> 21:58.630
Please give me 5 star rating.

22:00.672 --> 22:02.172
Ut, here's your banh mi.

22:02.214 --> 22:03.339
Thank you, oh, here you go.

22:04.130 --> 22:06.672
Kopi Luwak, I brewed it myself.

22:06.839 --> 22:09.339
Five bucks a kilo, I'm not sure
it's the real deal since it was that cheap.

22:09.589 --> 22:11.339
I don't think it is then.

22:11.380 --> 22:12.839
Still tastes good though.

22:13.089 --> 22:14.214
I'll head in then.

22:14.505 --> 22:15.880
Hey, Mai!

22:17.047 --> 22:18.964
Dao!

22:19.297 --> 22:21.672
How could you move here without telling me?

22:22.089 --> 22:23.880
Not yet, I'm talking.

22:24.380 --> 22:26.547
Not yet, I'm fixing my make up.

22:26.797 --> 22:28.505
Hang on! Not yet!

22:30.797 --> 22:33.714
I've been swamped ever since I moved here.

22:33.964 --> 22:35.339
I'm sorry.

22:35.339 --> 22:36.964
I thought you forgot about me.

22:37.547 --> 22:39.464
You're the only one that can satisfy me.

22:39.630 --> 22:42.089
I can live without men but
can't live without you.

22:42.589 --> 22:43.964
How is it here?

22:45.047 --> 22:46.839
It's not bad, people like me here.

22:47.505 --> 22:48.505
Mai, you bitch!

22:54.214 --> 22:56.255
Now I'm sure you're trying to ruin my life.

22:59.547 --> 23:00.755
Hey Diem,

23:01.089 --> 23:02.380
is it your turn?

23:02.422 --> 23:03.714
Still no.

23:03.755 --> 23:06.922
I get bumped everytime it gets to my turn.

23:07.130 --> 23:08.589
Mai is taking all the slots.

23:09.130 --> 23:11.380
Mai, come work for me.

23:11.755 --> 23:12.880
For real?

23:13.005 --> 23:13.964
Of course.

23:14.005 --> 23:16.089
None of my relatives can help my business.

23:16.255 --> 23:17.297
I trust you.

23:17.797 --> 23:18.880
Okay?

23:19.089 --> 23:21.380
It's tempting, but nah.

23:21.630 --> 23:22.714
Why?

23:23.422 --> 23:25.130
You're the only friend
I have here in Saigon.

23:25.505 --> 23:27.755
And when there's money involved,
it gets complicated.

23:28.047 --> 23:29.297
Just let me be

23:29.464 --> 23:31.047
your little sister.

23:31.714 --> 23:32.964
Stop chatting.

23:33.005 --> 23:34.797
Remeber to turn off the lights
when you leave.

23:34.797 --> 23:36.422
I got yelled at for three days straight.

23:36.464 --> 23:40.130
Hey Tu, how can Mai
cut in front of everyone?

23:40.214 --> 23:42.130
She's not, she's getting
requested by clients.

23:42.172 --> 23:43.630
Get a request... then I'll bump you up.

23:43.630 --> 23:47.297
Tu, I'm old, I can't compete with her.
She's sneaky.

23:47.464 --> 23:49.464
- That's the rule.
- Tu!

23:49.505 --> 23:52.547
- I forgot to gift you on your birthday.
- Don't do that.

23:52.714 --> 23:53.839
Don't do that.

23:54.005 --> 23:55.047
No.

23:58.297 --> 23:59.380
Don't do that.

24:10.214 --> 24:11.672
Step back fatty!

24:11.714 --> 24:13.464
You're taking up too much space!

24:16.255 --> 24:18.714
Hey, find a rich shoulder to lean on.

24:20.172 --> 24:22.130
You know all about me
and you still say that?

24:22.547 --> 24:24.755
I don't have any feelings for men.

24:26.005 --> 24:27.630
Okay, I see.

24:27.672 --> 24:29.172
A client is hitting on me.

24:29.339 --> 24:31.172
He thinks he's so fine.

24:31.214 --> 24:32.380
But is he?

24:33.089 --> 24:34.005
Kinda.

24:34.005 --> 24:35.630
Take him then. Life's too short.

24:35.714 --> 24:37.714
You're fine, he's fine,
a perfect match!

24:38.297 --> 24:39.172
Go ahead!

24:39.172 --> 24:40.797
- How am I fine?
- Right here.

24:42.714 --> 24:44.755
- Are they real?
- Real foam.

24:45.547 --> 24:46.630
Foam but real?

24:46.672 --> 24:48.839
- There are the real deal.
- Hey there.

24:48.880 --> 24:49.964
So naughty!

24:50.005 --> 24:51.339
How's Binh Minh?

24:51.714 --> 24:54.589
She's been so needy lately,

24:54.797 --> 24:57.589
wanting to get a job so
people don't call her a freeloader.

24:57.630 --> 24:59.130
How sweet!

24:59.172 --> 25:00.880
Let her help.

25:00.880 --> 25:02.880
She's your man, your perfect man.

25:03.130 --> 25:05.839
- It's hard to do everything by yourself.
- I know, I know.

25:07.964 --> 25:09.005
Trinh!

25:09.922 --> 25:11.005
What's going on?

25:16.630 --> 25:17.714
Diem...

25:17.755 --> 25:19.214
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

25:19.255 --> 25:20.464
What are we thinking?

25:21.839 --> 25:23.130
I hate Mai... so much.

25:25.589 --> 25:26.797
I...

25:53.755 --> 25:56.464
Why didn't you let me know
you've moved to Go Vap?

25:57.964 --> 25:59.089
Nam...

25:59.839 --> 26:01.005
Are you hiding from me?

26:07.380 --> 26:08.505
It hurts.

26:08.547 --> 26:10.464
You're hurting me!

26:10.589 --> 26:12.880
Let's talk, this hurts so much.

26:13.089 --> 26:14.880
Damn...

26:17.589 --> 26:19.172
I'm trying to make money.

26:19.172 --> 26:20.339
How?

26:22.255 --> 26:23.964
Mai will pay it.

26:24.755 --> 26:26.880
- Mai will pay?
- Yes, of course.

26:29.964 --> 26:31.339
So you'd better tell me earlier.

26:31.755 --> 26:33.339
If not, I'd think you're on the run.

26:33.339 --> 26:34.505
Got it?

26:40.047 --> 26:41.339
I'm heading out.

26:42.255 --> 26:43.339
Bye Lanh.

26:46.380 --> 26:48.339
What did you look at me for
when I was working?

26:49.672 --> 26:50.714
I know you know.

26:53.214 --> 26:54.339
Know what?

26:55.630 --> 26:57.672
Don't do that... here.

26:59.839 --> 27:00.964
Let me see you out.

27:11.964 --> 27:13.755
This job is scandalous enough,

27:14.047 --> 27:16.922
I don't want people to think
everyone is like you.

27:17.422 --> 27:19.339
Everyone needs this job to survive.

27:20.005 --> 27:21.839
So everyone needs this job to survive,

27:22.005 --> 27:23.130
but I don't?

27:26.214 --> 27:28.089
I hate bitches that preach moral lessons.

27:28.672 --> 27:31.047
You take all the clients from me
and then talk down to me?

27:31.297 --> 27:32.714
You're amazing Mai.

27:33.547 --> 27:35.380
I need the job, not the drama.

27:37.547 --> 27:38.880
Now tell me...

27:40.130 --> 27:41.589
How much do they need to pay

27:41.630 --> 27:43.255
for you to open your mouth?

27:43.964 --> 27:45.255
What do you want?

27:57.464 --> 27:58.630
Trinh!

27:59.589 --> 28:01.255
Is it your bike downstairs?

28:01.714 --> 28:02.839
Yeah.

28:03.214 --> 28:04.672
Yeah, that would be mine.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.214
Why did you leave it there?

28:06.380 --> 28:08.630
I was late and in a rush.

28:08.755 --> 28:10.714
Move it then, it caught me off guard.

28:10.755 --> 28:12.047
I'll head out soon.

28:15.505 --> 28:16.797
I really did want to hit you.

28:19.172 --> 28:20.589
- Bye.
- Okay.

28:22.422 --> 28:23.630
What was she doing to you?

28:24.714 --> 28:26.630
- It's okay.
- Let me know right away.

28:27.326 --> 28:27.820
Yes.

28:27.845 --> 28:29.011
I've been watching her.

28:41.755 --> 28:45.639
[Are you home yet?
Want some food?]

28:45.664 --> 28:46.781
[I'm home but tired. G9.]

28:58.172 --> 28:59.964
[Hey! Hang on! I wanna...]

29:16.172 --> 29:17.297
Be careful!

29:17.714 --> 29:19.214
What are you doing down there?

29:19.255 --> 29:21.380
I was holding the chair for you.

29:21.630 --> 29:25.089
It's dangerous for a girl
to climb that high up.

29:26.089 --> 29:28.255
The wire is just a little loose.

29:28.505 --> 29:29.714
Go get some tape,

29:29.755 --> 29:31.089
I'll fix it for you.

29:31.964 --> 29:34.589
- Oh, okay.
- Yeah, go get it.

30:00.964 --> 30:02.839
Hey, what are you doing?

30:04.339 --> 30:05.422
I like you.

30:06.130 --> 30:07.672
I'll scream.

30:07.922 --> 30:08.964
Don't.

30:09.297 --> 30:10.547
I know what you do.

30:10.630 --> 30:11.797
How much? Tell me.

30:11.839 --> 30:13.422
You pervert!

30:13.964 --> 30:15.464
Hey, stay away from me!

30:15.547 --> 30:17.130
Don't scream, listen to me.

30:17.172 --> 30:18.214
Stay away!

30:18.755 --> 30:19.964
Don't run.

30:20.672 --> 30:22.005
- Calm down.
- What is it?

30:22.130 --> 30:23.630
- What's wrong?
- He's harrassing me.

30:24.630 --> 30:26.297
Calm down, let's talk this out.

30:26.339 --> 30:28.130
It's not what you're thinking, hey!

30:28.130 --> 30:29.089
Ouch!

30:29.130 --> 30:31.630
I got hit, you need to protect me Officer.

30:32.797 --> 30:35.422
- Did you break in to her house?
- Answer.

30:35.630 --> 30:38.464
Hey, you punched me in the face,
don't talk to me like that.

30:38.505 --> 30:39.880
Officer, look at him.

30:40.047 --> 30:42.255
I ask again, did you break into her house?

30:42.380 --> 30:44.755
I know it, but I was hit, Officer.

30:44.755 --> 30:46.672
The two of them made plan to harm me...

30:46.714 --> 30:48.839
They asked did you get in her house?

30:48.880 --> 30:51.964
I know it but I was hit,
why don't you ask him instead of asking me?

30:52.005 --> 30:54.297
Last time,
did you get into her house?

30:54.547 --> 30:57.964
I know, but it hurts so bad,
no one cares about me?

30:58.089 --> 30:59.172
So you wanna fight again?

31:03.297 --> 31:05.422
- He's attacking my husband!
- Calm down! Stop!

31:05.547 --> 31:07.089
Stop! Calm down! Calm down!

31:07.422 --> 31:09.547
- He hit me!
- I got it! Got it!

31:09.630 --> 31:10.839
My gosh!

31:12.964 --> 31:15.339
If you didn't stop me,
that'd be the last time he can talk.

31:15.380 --> 31:16.755
Okay okay, my hero!

31:16.755 --> 31:17.839
Have a seat.

31:18.464 --> 31:20.630
How can you find a place this late?

31:20.630 --> 31:21.839
You like it?

31:22.214 --> 31:23.755
I'm better than Google map.

31:24.380 --> 31:26.422
Obviously you took enough girls out
to know places.

31:26.464 --> 31:29.130
It's a miracle I go out with you
at this hour.

31:29.255 --> 31:31.422
No one talks to their benefactor like that.

31:32.130 --> 31:34.464
Fine, okay, thank you so much.

31:34.505 --> 31:36.047
Isn't that sweet?

31:36.630 --> 31:38.255
You can call me SAU (worm) from now on.

31:38.297 --> 31:39.964
What? Sau?

31:40.005 --> 31:41.755
That's right. My nickname at home.

31:43.297 --> 31:44.422
That's a weird name.

31:44.464 --> 31:46.464
Let's order.
They have amazing rice noodles.

31:46.964 --> 31:48.255
- Hey.
- Yes?

31:48.297 --> 31:50.464
Two special dry noodles.

31:50.505 --> 31:52.172
- Serve her well, she's my boss.
- Got it.

31:52.630 --> 31:54.255
How can you talk like that?

31:54.755 --> 31:56.380
He's just a worker like we are.

31:56.380 --> 31:58.714
Can you add "please"
at the end of the sentence, please?

31:58.839 --> 32:00.297
- Hi
- Yes?

32:00.422 --> 32:02.089
Two bowls of dry noodles... please!

32:02.130 --> 32:03.380
- Got it.
- Thank you.

32:03.755 --> 32:04.797
Good?

32:05.505 --> 32:06.964
How old are you to be so serious?

32:06.964 --> 32:09.755
How old are you to ask me such a question?

32:10.172 --> 32:11.505
I know I look young,

32:11.714 --> 32:13.422
but I'm turning thirty this year.

32:13.755 --> 32:16.755
You have no idea
what a "young" person looks like.

32:16.964 --> 32:18.005
What about you?

32:18.047 --> 32:20.464
Oh, I'm only seven years... older than you.

32:20.797 --> 32:21.839
Thirty-seven.

32:23.714 --> 32:25.339
With that face?

32:26.380 --> 32:27.839
I'd take that as another compliment.

32:28.339 --> 32:29.422
I know you're kidding.

32:30.130 --> 32:32.130
Do I look like I am?

32:33.005 --> 32:34.422
Show some respect for your elders.

32:35.005 --> 32:37.380
How can I call you an elder
when I'm having a crush on you?

32:37.380 --> 32:39.130
That's gonna lead us no where.

32:39.380 --> 32:41.172
We'd better keep things the same.

32:42.964 --> 32:44.089
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

32:44.714 --> 32:46.047
- Do you have coffee?
- We do.

32:46.339 --> 32:47.755
One black coffee, no sugar please.

32:47.797 --> 32:48.797
Sure, just a moment.

32:48.922 --> 32:50.339
Why would you drink that?

32:50.505 --> 32:52.130
How can you sleep?

32:52.130 --> 32:54.255
Just a habit, I can sleep just fine.

32:54.672 --> 32:56.755
That's how the miserables look like.

32:57.880 --> 32:59.547
Your life will be better with me in it.

33:01.089 --> 33:02.297
Sure, let's eat.

33:12.089 --> 33:13.130
Thank you.

33:17.672 --> 33:19.089
Do I look like a hooker?

33:20.464 --> 33:21.589
What now?

33:21.880 --> 33:24.422
Why would everyone think I'm a dirty girl?

33:25.297 --> 33:26.672
I wouldn't hit on a dirty girl.

33:27.130 --> 33:28.380
I'm not kidding.

33:28.589 --> 33:29.755
Neither am I.

33:29.964 --> 33:32.130
Why did you get handsy when
you first met me?

33:32.505 --> 33:35.755
I was handsy because you're pretty,
not because you're dirty.

33:37.714 --> 33:38.922
Fine,

33:38.964 --> 33:41.339
I admit that I was a bad person,

33:41.464 --> 33:43.589
I wasn't polite enough, I'm sorry.

33:43.755 --> 33:46.297
You can see I stopped being handsy.

33:46.339 --> 33:48.464
You'd better stay that way.

33:48.505 --> 33:49.714
I will.

33:51.755 --> 33:54.172
- Why don't you pick up your mom's call?
- How do you know?

33:54.214 --> 33:56.547
It's a privilege to have a family
who cares about you.

33:56.630 --> 33:58.755
- What if it's something urgent?
- Okay, okay.

33:59.922 --> 34:02.630
- Yes mami?
- Are you ever gonna come home?

34:04.130 --> 34:05.130
What do you mean?

34:05.172 --> 34:08.464
Ever since you moved out, you forget
all about us.

34:09.005 --> 34:10.297
I know, I know.

34:10.589 --> 34:13.464
- I'll make some time to come home.
- Nah, you do you.

34:13.464 --> 34:14.880
I'm angry now.

34:17.089 --> 34:19.005
Mami said she misses me,

34:19.047 --> 34:21.422
and told me to bring my girlfriend around.

34:22.047 --> 34:23.839
You don't look like the
love-your-mom type.

34:23.880 --> 34:25.005
You're judging me.

34:26.505 --> 34:28.130
What does a love-your-mom face look like?

34:28.547 --> 34:31.047
Don't expect people not to judge you
when you're judging people.

34:32.589 --> 34:34.047
Don't give me that smile.

34:34.505 --> 34:35.880
Go on another ride with me instead.

34:35.922 --> 34:37.589
Learn how to pay your benefactor back.

34:37.630 --> 34:39.839
Nah, it's late.

34:40.214 --> 34:41.255
I'm tired.

34:41.297 --> 34:43.089
- Tomorrow.
- Tomorrow again?

34:43.505 --> 34:44.964
I know Mai means tomorrow,

34:45.130 --> 34:47.589
but try to say okay sometimes.

34:48.172 --> 34:49.422
Don't freaking lie!

34:49.464 --> 34:51.755
Did she lure you in
or you went in by yourself?

34:51.755 --> 34:53.964
Of course she lured me in,
I'm a married man.

34:54.130 --> 34:55.380
Cuong, you tell her, please. 

34:55.380 --> 34:56.380
I think she's right.

34:56.505 --> 34:58.589
- What can we do now?
- Wanna do me?

34:59.255 --> 35:01.589
Watch your mouth.
Lose that tone.

35:01.630 --> 35:03.630
- You hit me asshole! Remember my face!
- What?

35:03.630 --> 35:05.297
- What do you want?
- Let go of me!

35:05.880 --> 35:07.297
You think I'm scared?

35:07.797 --> 35:09.005
Let him go.

35:09.005 --> 35:10.547
I wanna see what he's gonna do.

35:10.630 --> 35:13.589
You talk a big talk for your size.

35:15.880 --> 35:17.214
Another one.

35:20.422 --> 35:21.464
Are you okay?

35:21.464 --> 35:23.505
Don't underestimate me.

35:24.047 --> 35:25.255
I'm a good drinker.

35:25.505 --> 35:27.214
It's just that I quit drinking
a long time ago.

35:27.255 --> 35:29.214
So open your eyes wide if you can.

35:30.755 --> 35:31.880
Keep them there.

35:34.005 --> 35:35.630
It's really cute here.

35:36.089 --> 35:37.922
I start to like the bartender,

35:38.255 --> 35:40.880
so try to be more professional.

35:41.255 --> 35:43.214
Who told you I'm a bartender?

35:48.672 --> 35:50.172
It's nice!

35:51.589 --> 35:53.547
I work here, not over there.

36:46.089 --> 36:47.172
That was great.

36:48.047 --> 36:49.255
"The Autumn Clouds", right?

36:49.880 --> 36:51.005
How did you know?

36:52.380 --> 36:55.089
My mom used to listen to
Tu Cong Phung's songs.

36:55.714 --> 36:58.297
Nice, I didn't think you'd know this song.

36:58.505 --> 36:59.755
You're judging me now.

37:00.547 --> 37:02.505
A masseuse can't listen to music?

37:02.505 --> 37:04.297
I meant only older people like these songs.

37:04.339 --> 37:05.880
You're judging me again.

37:05.922 --> 37:07.422
You're calling me old?

37:07.464 --> 37:11.130
Come on! I mean why would
someone your age listen to these songs,

37:11.255 --> 37:14.047
meaning you have good taste,
young lady.

37:14.589 --> 37:15.880
Fine.

37:15.964 --> 37:17.297
Keep playing, brother.

37:23.755 --> 37:25.755
- Cheers!
- Cheers! Damn you drink a lot!

37:25.797 --> 37:27.214
I told you I'm a good drinker.

37:27.214 --> 37:28.380
What an alcoholic!

37:30.380 --> 37:32.380
- Play more songs.
- I'm out of songs.

37:32.422 --> 37:35.130
Of course there are more.
Do something interesting!

37:37.005 --> 37:38.047
Hang on!

37:50.130 --> 37:51.297
M'lady!

37:54.964 --> 37:56.380
Are you crazy?

37:59.339 --> 38:00.464
M'lady.

38:00.547 --> 38:01.672
Would you care for a dance?

38:02.297 --> 38:04.505
Nah, I don't dance.

38:04.547 --> 38:05.797
Are you lying?

38:06.630 --> 38:08.297
You're crazy! I can't dance.

38:08.380 --> 38:11.422
You're old now, you'll get a belly
if you don't exercise.

38:12.380 --> 38:14.505
How dare you say that to a pretty woman?

38:14.505 --> 38:16.630
- So can I dance with you as an apology?
- I told you I can't dance.

38:16.672 --> 38:18.505
If you don't dance
I'll take you to see the noodle man.

38:18.505 --> 38:19.714
You're insane!

39:16.547 --> 39:17.672
I love you!

39:37.255 --> 39:39.255
What a nice couple you are!

39:39.255 --> 39:42.089
You're so pretty Mai!
Kiss! Kiss!

39:54.630 --> 39:55.672
Eww!

39:56.464 --> 39:58.714
I'm done, so tired.

39:59.214 --> 40:02.214
- Get up! It's not over yet!
- I'm old, leave me alone.

40:15.339 --> 40:16.589
Are you okay?

40:17.172 --> 40:18.464
Can you still work?

40:18.964 --> 40:20.214
Here comes the yawn.

40:21.505 --> 40:22.547
I'm fine.

40:24.505 --> 40:25.589
Hey!

40:26.255 --> 40:27.464
Binh Minh!

40:41.589 --> 40:42.755
What's wrong?

40:43.422 --> 40:45.172
Why didn't you call me?

40:45.214 --> 40:46.464
I did, you didn't pick up.

40:46.964 --> 40:49.172
- Were you drinking?
- Just a little bit.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.922
Who's this?

40:53.005 --> 40:54.422
Binh Minh, my daughter.

40:54.755 --> 40:55.880
Biological daughter.

40:57.672 --> 40:58.755
Sorry.

40:59.047 --> 41:01.255
Mai, I need to talk to you.

41:03.047 --> 41:04.214
Good morning sir.

41:04.255 --> 41:05.297
Alright.

41:05.422 --> 41:07.172
Too much information in a day, right?

41:07.255 --> 41:09.297
Go home if you want to have
a family meeting.

41:09.339 --> 41:10.922
Clear the way!

41:10.922 --> 41:12.339
Don't need to be that aggressive.

41:12.380 --> 41:14.547
You're ruining my morning. Move.

41:14.547 --> 41:15.422
Go away.

41:15.422 --> 41:17.547
Do you want me to call the Officer?

41:19.255 --> 41:20.339
I will. I will.

41:22.464 --> 41:23.714
Again?

41:27.630 --> 41:29.297
How many times have you promised to stop?

41:30.505 --> 41:32.255
Stop driving me insane.

41:33.172 --> 41:34.797
How dare she treat her dad like that?

41:34.797 --> 41:36.297
She looks ungrateful.

41:36.339 --> 41:37.464
Shut up and listen.

41:37.505 --> 41:39.047
Look at this.

41:39.130 --> 41:40.755
How much in total already?

41:42.505 --> 41:44.130
You were working so hard.

41:44.547 --> 41:48.714
My friends said Barcelona was doing well,
I didn't think I'd lose that much.

41:49.505 --> 41:51.964
I wouldn't have reached out if
it's not dangerous.

41:52.005 --> 41:53.047
They're...

41:53.130 --> 41:54.755
They're threatening Binh Minh.

42:04.047 --> 42:06.839
Why can't you quit gambling?

42:11.214 --> 42:13.714
- You're not in it, you wouldn't know.
- Who can actually know?

42:14.380 --> 42:15.464
Why do you keep...

42:15.547 --> 42:17.922
Why do you keep doing this to me?

42:22.339 --> 42:23.839
I know I'm wrong.

42:24.922 --> 42:27.297
Please help me this time.

42:28.797 --> 42:29.839
Please.

42:29.880 --> 42:30.880
How much?

42:30.880 --> 42:32.255
Just over two and a half grand.

42:32.964 --> 42:34.214
Otherwise they're...

42:35.380 --> 42:37.130
It's fine if you don't want to.

42:50.255 --> 42:51.547
Drink some water.

42:51.714 --> 42:52.964
Stop acting.

42:53.880 --> 42:55.089
Take the money.

43:02.672 --> 43:03.714
I'm sorry.

43:05.464 --> 43:06.464
Some water?

43:12.005 --> 43:14.005
- I swear...
- Don't, I swear

43:14.380 --> 43:15.922
one more time and you're dead to me.

43:16.464 --> 43:18.380
Aunties, please make way.

43:18.630 --> 43:21.464
Why are you crowding
outside her house? Let's move.

43:21.464 --> 43:22.797
I'm moving, can't you see?

43:23.130 --> 43:24.422
Dismiss.

43:26.964 --> 43:28.630
Give me the keys, I'll head out first.

43:30.172 --> 43:32.255
Talk to your mom, she's mad at me.

43:37.255 --> 43:39.005
Drink this for the hangover.

43:39.172 --> 43:40.339
I know you're tired.

43:41.547 --> 43:43.130
I called you so many times yesterday.

43:43.214 --> 43:44.505
They were aggressive.

43:45.005 --> 43:46.297
Did they do anything to you?

43:46.464 --> 43:48.380
Not yet, but I'm not sure about later.

43:48.797 --> 43:50.547
But I think he'll quit for real this time.

43:50.547 --> 43:51.589
It was intense.

43:52.880 --> 43:55.255
Come live with me, leave him.

43:55.464 --> 43:57.005
Get a boyfriend then I'll come.

43:57.755 --> 43:59.214
Again with this boyfriend thing...

44:00.297 --> 44:02.297
Why did I stay with him
and let you move out then?

44:02.422 --> 44:04.672
No one would hit on you
if I keep tagging along.

44:05.672 --> 44:07.714
You like the tall dude?

44:09.214 --> 44:10.839
Nah, he's just a neighbor.

44:11.130 --> 44:12.964
You pulled an allnighter with a neighbor?

44:13.047 --> 44:14.339
I didn't.

44:14.672 --> 44:16.380
You don't have to deny it.

44:18.380 --> 44:19.547
I like you.

44:19.797 --> 44:20.797
I love you.

44:20.839 --> 44:22.547
We only need one lesbian
in the household.

44:26.714 --> 44:27.839
Have a boyfriend.

44:35.089 --> 44:36.964
Why did you grow up so fast?

44:39.589 --> 44:41.505
Because you don't want to be happy.

44:42.839 --> 44:44.505
Stop abusing yourself.

44:52.422 --> 44:53.839
Thank you honey.

45:41.505 --> 45:44.714
Ouch, I'm bleeding Mai.
What are you doing?

45:45.089 --> 45:46.630
My baby is crying. I'm sorry.

45:46.630 --> 45:48.130
I'll just go somewhere else.

45:49.464 --> 45:50.630
Miss...

45:51.130 --> 45:52.630
Just take care of your child.

45:53.255 --> 45:54.922
I can get right back to it.

45:58.672 --> 46:00.755
Hang on, stop crying, I'm trying.

46:01.755 --> 46:04.422
I said I know, why are you still crying?

46:05.255 --> 46:06.589
What else do you want?

46:08.839 --> 46:11.005
Sis! Sis!

46:11.047 --> 46:13.005
- What's wrong?
- My baby has a fever,

46:13.005 --> 46:15.630
- please take us to the hospital.
- Go get the keys.

46:28.130 --> 46:30.255
What happened? Are you okay?

46:30.255 --> 46:31.547
Why do you keep hitting my child?

46:31.547 --> 46:34.047
Mai, tell her to stay away from my kid.

46:34.339 --> 46:36.880
It's just kids playing around.
I'm sorry.

46:37.505 --> 46:38.797
It's okay baby, it's okay.

46:38.839 --> 46:40.089
Let me see, baby.

46:43.880 --> 46:44.964
Mai!

46:46.464 --> 46:49.464
They seized my house, can I live with you?

46:49.755 --> 46:50.964
Don't be mad.

46:52.505 --> 46:53.547
That's your daughter?

46:55.214 --> 46:57.422
Just a moment, she should be here soon.

46:59.547 --> 47:00.880
Why did you bring her?

47:02.922 --> 47:05.005
I'm in the wrong room, excuse me.
Let's go.

47:05.797 --> 47:08.214
Please wait here. Mai! Mai!

47:08.297 --> 47:09.422
Binh Minh!

47:09.422 --> 47:11.630
Here, come dust this blanket for me.

47:11.964 --> 47:13.172
Mom?

47:13.214 --> 47:15.172
Why do we need to dust a clean blanket?

47:16.089 --> 47:17.922
Even the cleanest blanket is dusty.

47:18.172 --> 47:19.339
Help me please.

47:21.839 --> 47:23.964
Even the cleanest blanket is dusty.

47:24.755 --> 47:26.089
Help me please.

47:29.464 --> 47:31.130
I think I look like her more than you do.

47:31.214 --> 47:33.672
You get to work now, happy?

47:34.380 --> 47:36.089
I don't even know what to say.

47:36.839 --> 47:38.880
Stop with the thanking.

47:39.172 --> 47:40.922
I'm helping my niece, not you.

47:41.172 --> 47:42.797
Just let her get some experience
working part-time here,

47:42.839 --> 47:44.880
then she can go wherever
when she get a full time job.

47:44.922 --> 47:46.672
I'd have to hire someone either way.

47:47.130 --> 47:48.755
- Here's your check.
- What is this?

47:48.922 --> 47:51.714
- I have to pay for my coffee.
- Okay pay away.

47:52.047 --> 47:54.380
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

47:54.589 --> 47:55.672
Where's the tip?

47:55.672 --> 47:57.964
Nope, only one of us can get tips.

47:58.089 --> 47:59.297
Pulling rank here?

47:59.880 --> 48:01.089
Here, this is for you.

48:01.922 --> 48:04.630
- What is this?
- Girls need a little bling to get a boy.

48:04.630 --> 48:06.172
You dress like my mom.

48:06.172 --> 48:09.047
- It's expensive, I don't want it.
- It's silver, doesn't cost much.

48:09.089 --> 48:11.547
Silver? Can I get a ring too then?

48:11.589 --> 48:15.005
- It's white gold!
- See, such a simple test.

48:15.505 --> 48:17.714
It's not much at all.
Just wear it...

48:17.755 --> 48:20.339
Thank you Boss for giving me this nice job,
I'll serve my best.

48:21.255 --> 48:22.630
Oh hey, leave the bike there.

48:23.172 --> 48:25.130
Go ahead. Head inside.

48:26.589 --> 48:27.714
Give me your bike.

48:27.880 --> 48:29.005
Go inside.

48:30.005 --> 48:31.464
- Hey hey!
- What?

48:31.464 --> 48:32.839
Let me get the door for you.

48:32.839 --> 48:34.630
- It's automatic.
- Oh, is that so?

48:35.172 --> 48:36.214
So modern!

48:36.964 --> 48:39.005
- Work hard, okay?
- This way!

48:40.255 --> 48:41.672
Safe travel!

48:41.797 --> 48:43.630
- Let me close the door.
- It's automatic.

48:43.672 --> 48:44.714
Oh yeah I forgot.

48:45.005 --> 48:46.047
That's nice.

48:46.839 --> 48:48.047
How's your boyfriend?

48:48.297 --> 48:49.547
He saw my kid and disappeared.

48:49.589 --> 48:51.089
Asshole, is he ghosting you?

48:51.172 --> 48:53.380
- No, I'm ghosting him.
- What the heck?

48:53.505 --> 48:57.339
- Why are you ghosting him?
- I saw the pause, I know what that means.

48:57.505 --> 49:01.214
Hey Mai, don't take it too serious.

49:01.755 --> 49:04.797
He's young and free, a child
came out of no where,

49:05.047 --> 49:06.630
of course he's gonna pause.

49:06.630 --> 49:08.964
Give him time to process that.

49:09.339 --> 49:12.422
You have a child, you're the underhand,
try to understand.

49:12.547 --> 49:13.672
I tried to understand.

49:14.297 --> 49:15.672
She's just eight years older than me.

49:15.714 --> 49:17.339
I think that's normal nowadays.

49:17.839 --> 49:19.630
As long as she's still hot.

49:19.630 --> 49:22.172
But she has an add-on.

49:22.880 --> 49:24.130
You're insane.

49:24.172 --> 49:25.714
Nope! You're in love.

49:25.880 --> 49:27.547
- Who said?
- Your eyes.

49:27.797 --> 49:30.672
- Don't hide things from me.
- I'm not.

49:31.089 --> 49:32.130
Yes I am!

49:32.380 --> 49:34.714
- I'm serious this time.
- This is chaos!

49:34.755 --> 49:37.714
Lady killer, young, 6-pack owner,

49:37.880 --> 49:40.380
versus a babysitter, used,
and eight year older.

49:40.755 --> 49:42.839
- So what?
- So fall in love.

49:42.880 --> 49:44.047
Life's too short.

49:44.089 --> 49:46.797
But he's too young, not the mature kind.

49:46.839 --> 49:49.547
Don't find a mature guy to love,
just love him and he'll mature.

49:49.589 --> 49:50.797
She's mature,

49:51.964 --> 49:53.214
and you're hooked for sure.

49:53.839 --> 49:55.172
She's just fishing.

49:55.255 --> 49:58.047
- You just got hooked.
- She's not like that.

49:58.547 --> 50:00.922
- What is she like then?
- Then he'll find you.

50:00.922 --> 50:02.089
Trust me.

50:02.755 --> 50:04.005
Of course I trust you.

50:04.214 --> 50:05.214
Jerk!

50:05.255 --> 50:06.505
I haven't seen you in a while.

50:06.505 --> 50:07.714
You look handsome today.

50:08.505 --> 50:09.755
Have you booked anyone?

50:10.130 --> 50:11.339
Can I work on you?

50:12.839 --> 50:14.089
Life's too short.

50:14.172 --> 50:16.547
He'll look for you, believe me.
Just give him a chance.

50:16.589 --> 50:17.964
Drop your ego.

50:18.172 --> 50:19.589
Not yet, I'm coming.

50:19.755 --> 50:20.755
I'll head out then.

50:20.797 --> 50:22.547
- Bye bye. I love you.
- Bye!

50:26.297 --> 50:28.422
Remember: Life's too short.

50:28.505 --> 50:29.922
I'm coming.

50:31.380 --> 50:33.797
I got it. I guarantee you'll be satisfied.

50:36.505 --> 50:37.630
Book Mai for me.

50:38.589 --> 50:40.214
She's busy today.

50:40.255 --> 50:42.755
- I can wait.
- Can you wait three or four rounds?

50:43.964 --> 50:45.505
"Diem" is here for you.

50:45.880 --> 50:47.005
Let me serve you.

50:47.880 --> 50:49.005
Thank you.

50:49.089 --> 50:50.255
- I'll head out then.
- Okay.

50:51.297 --> 50:52.505
You wanna break the rules?

50:52.714 --> 50:53.880
Watch out!

50:54.464 --> 50:55.880
Okay, fine.

50:56.255 --> 50:58.964
- All the clients are Mai's.
- Thank you sir. Come back soon.

50:59.005 --> 51:01.464
You think you can out-slut her
to take on her clients?

51:01.755 --> 51:02.964
Really?

51:03.130 --> 51:05.755
I don't think so. I think she's clean.

51:06.505 --> 51:07.505
She's not like that.

51:09.214 --> 51:10.505
You're from the same hometown?

51:12.464 --> 51:14.755
Do you know why she's busy and you're not?

51:17.089 --> 51:18.797
It's because you don't have any tricks.

51:22.755 --> 51:25.005
- Have a good night.
- Thank you, Mai. This is for you.

51:25.005 --> 51:27.339
- You already tipped me.
- It's so late, just take it.

51:27.464 --> 51:29.005
Thank you so much.

51:31.589 --> 51:33.339
Take care of this for me please.

51:34.380 --> 51:36.255
- Thank you.
- I'm heading out.

51:36.297 --> 51:37.755
Me too, you were my last client.

51:37.964 --> 51:39.005
Okay, bye.

51:49.214 --> 51:50.672
Who locked the door?

51:51.214 --> 51:52.255
Hey!

51:54.130 --> 51:55.255
Anyone there?

51:57.630 --> 51:58.964
Who locked it?

51:59.005 --> 52:01.422
- Trinh, is this okay?
- Open up!

52:01.464 --> 52:03.797
Have you seen any one died
from being locked in a restroom?

52:04.255 --> 52:06.964
She took late clients
because she likes the dark.

52:07.005 --> 52:08.464
- Let's help her.
- Anyone?

52:08.505 --> 52:09.464
Tu!

52:09.505 --> 52:10.964
Tu said turn off the lights.

52:11.005 --> 52:12.172
Uncle Ut!

52:12.214 --> 52:15.505
Hey, who's that? Open up!

52:15.589 --> 52:16.880
Uncle Ut!

52:22.380 --> 52:23.589
Anyone out there?

52:23.755 --> 52:25.630
Anyone?

52:52.630 --> 52:53.797
Mai?

52:54.339 --> 52:56.005
- Mai?
- Uncle Ut!

52:56.255 --> 52:57.589
- I'm in here.
- Where?

53:02.130 --> 53:04.422
These two are unbelievable.

53:05.130 --> 53:06.880
Do you want me to tell management?

53:06.922 --> 53:08.047
No...

53:08.630 --> 53:09.964
I don't want this to blow up.

53:10.505 --> 53:11.630
I'm okay.

53:13.005 --> 53:15.089
How did you know I was still here?

53:15.714 --> 53:18.422
You didn't say goodbye so
I came looking for you.

53:40.464 --> 53:41.630
Thank you.

53:43.339 --> 53:45.339
Try to avoid them.

53:45.839 --> 53:48.464
They're mean. Tell me if you need anything.

53:51.964 --> 53:54.630
It would be good to have
a father like you.

53:55.589 --> 53:56.755
Is it not good now?

53:57.505 --> 53:58.922
Sleep well, daughter.

54:04.255 --> 54:05.547
Good night.

54:10.505 --> 54:11.797
You still up?

54:12.380 --> 54:13.505
Yeah.

54:14.839 --> 54:15.922
Hey, it's your girl!

54:17.089 --> 54:19.089
Is she turning you on?

54:20.505 --> 54:22.589
- I heard she's a hooker.
- Really?

54:23.214 --> 54:25.339
What? You're not answering.

54:27.089 --> 54:29.297
Why are people so mean to me?

54:29.297 --> 54:30.714
I didn't do anything.

54:30.839 --> 54:32.505
Why do they want to cause troubles?

54:32.672 --> 54:34.089
Of course you didn't do anything.

54:34.380 --> 54:35.964
- That's enough.
- Hey!

54:36.130 --> 54:39.172
- Please!
- Now you're trying to cause trouble?

54:39.172 --> 54:40.380
This is hard liquor.

54:40.714 --> 54:42.255
- That's why I'm drin...
- Stop.

54:44.880 --> 54:46.172
Why do you like me?

54:49.214 --> 54:50.589
Why are you avoiding me?

54:51.505 --> 54:52.505
I'm not.

54:52.505 --> 54:54.964
I'm asking you to be my drinking buddy.

54:55.130 --> 54:56.255
Cheers!

54:59.339 --> 55:00.672
You look funny when you're drunk.

55:01.505 --> 55:02.964
Remember the night at the bar?

55:04.005 --> 55:05.630
I haven't had that much fun
in a while.

55:07.172 --> 55:09.255
Why can't we still be fun?

55:10.005 --> 55:11.630
Because of your eyes.

55:11.922 --> 55:13.089
My eyes?

55:13.255 --> 55:15.630
They can't hide the emotions.

55:15.714 --> 55:16.839
What emotion?

55:16.880 --> 55:20.047
When you see my daughter,

55:20.047 --> 55:21.297
my dad,

55:21.339 --> 55:22.630
if I could,

55:22.672 --> 55:25.047
I wish I could turn into a mirror,

55:25.797 --> 55:28.505
so you can see
how your face look like then.

55:38.380 --> 55:39.464
Okay, to be honest,

55:40.422 --> 55:41.547
I paused.

55:41.755 --> 55:43.672
Because I didn't think she'd be that big.

55:44.714 --> 55:46.422
I meant your daughter.

55:46.797 --> 55:49.589
I didn't think you'd have
that old of a child.

55:49.964 --> 55:51.922
I thought about it a lot that night.

55:52.130 --> 55:53.714
It's just her child.

55:54.255 --> 55:55.339
So what?

55:56.255 --> 55:58.547
I've been with many girls,

55:58.630 --> 56:00.797
so it's normal for her to have a child.

56:01.005 --> 56:03.630
If your child was a toddler,

56:04.380 --> 56:06.380
I admit I can't imagine

56:06.714 --> 56:08.714
how I'd raise her with you.

56:08.797 --> 56:10.964
Luckily, she's all grown up.

56:11.172 --> 56:13.714
Let's just say I have a new friend.

56:13.755 --> 56:16.964
It's easy to take care of a friend.

56:17.089 --> 56:18.130
I love friends.

56:18.214 --> 56:20.089
Every age has its difficulties.

56:20.130 --> 56:21.714
It's not as simple as you think.

56:21.797 --> 56:23.755
Can you please let me be responsible
for taking care of you two?

56:23.797 --> 56:26.380
- And stop shutting it down.
- Okay okay.

56:26.380 --> 56:29.755
You're okay with me,
but your family won't.

56:29.964 --> 56:32.964
Right? I've experienced it before.

56:33.630 --> 56:35.255
There's your excuse.

56:39.755 --> 56:41.505
So what do you want from me?

56:43.422 --> 56:44.922
Be your boyfriend.

56:52.672 --> 56:54.005
I know I'm a stubborn kid,

56:55.839 --> 56:57.755
I always think about myself.

56:59.297 --> 57:00.797
My mom always took care of me,

57:00.922 --> 57:02.172
since we're rich,

57:02.464 --> 57:05.880
so she wants me to do things her way.

57:06.255 --> 57:08.047
But I hate that.

57:08.630 --> 57:10.297
I want my own life.

57:11.005 --> 57:12.714
I like to nurture my emotions.

57:12.755 --> 57:14.089
Girls come for me.

57:14.130 --> 57:15.755
Everything seems so easy.

57:15.880 --> 57:17.714
That's why I took them for granted.

57:18.714 --> 57:20.839
Stop that! Bad guy!

57:22.089 --> 57:23.255
I'm not denying.

57:23.505 --> 57:24.672
I know I'm bad.

57:25.422 --> 57:27.005
But that was just before I met you.

57:29.255 --> 57:30.589
You've changed me.

57:32.672 --> 57:33.964
Ever since I met you,

57:34.672 --> 57:36.630
I want to have a serious relationship,

57:36.714 --> 57:38.922
and I really want to care for someone.

57:49.214 --> 57:50.339
Don't love me.

57:52.297 --> 57:53.422
My past is bad.

57:58.047 --> 57:59.630
Don't give me hope.

59:11.089 --> 59:12.255
You okay?

59:14.755 --> 59:16.672
Want someone to sleep with?

59:24.380 --> 59:25.505
Mai!

59:28.422 --> 59:29.922
Will we meet again?

59:46.422 --> 59:47.505
Okay.

01:00:20.297 --> 01:00:21.339
It's okay.

01:00:22.339 --> 01:00:23.755
It's fine.

01:00:28.589 --> 01:00:29.630
Okay.

01:00:30.005 --> 01:00:31.714
You're a good guy.

01:00:37.214 --> 01:00:39.422
- I appreciate it.
- This is dirty now.

01:00:40.604 --> 01:00:41.687
Bye!

01:01:12.906 --> 01:01:14.195
[Block this contact]

01:01:16.187 --> 01:01:17.601
[Block this contact]

01:01:18.883 --> 01:01:19.781
[Block this contact]

01:01:21.273 --> 01:01:22.695
[Delete this app?]

01:01:34.167 --> 01:01:35.333
Are you okay?

01:01:37.422 --> 01:01:39.672
Were you disgusted by the vomit?

01:01:42.005 --> 01:01:43.130
No.

01:01:45.630 --> 01:01:46.672
Good.

01:01:57.964 --> 01:01:59.005
Mai...

01:01:59.964 --> 01:02:01.464
Forget the past.

01:02:03.214 --> 01:02:04.589
Wanna make a bet?

01:02:06.172 --> 01:02:07.297
If I failed,

01:02:07.964 --> 01:02:09.422
I'll be your new past.

01:02:11.297 --> 01:02:12.630
If I succeeded,

01:02:13.839 --> 01:02:15.630
we will be each other new tomorrow.

01:02:19.380 --> 01:02:20.547
Would you dare to

01:02:21.755 --> 01:02:22.880
fall in love?

01:02:30.755 --> 01:02:31.839
Don't...

01:02:32.880 --> 01:02:33.964
Don't...

01:02:39.214 --> 01:02:40.422
I'm ugly.

01:02:46.297 --> 01:02:47.505
We don't have to.

01:02:48.339 --> 01:02:49.589
It's okay, it's okay.

01:02:50.089 --> 01:02:52.214
You're okay.

01:02:52.630 --> 01:02:54.339
- You're okay.
- No, I want this.

01:03:03.755 --> 01:03:04.797
Here.

01:03:06.672 --> 01:03:08.214
From a fight when I was young.

01:03:09.297 --> 01:03:10.422
This one.

01:03:10.714 --> 01:03:13.005
Got attacked while hitting on
a girl at the bar.

01:03:14.089 --> 01:03:15.964
Everyone has a scar from the past.

01:03:17.380 --> 01:03:19.005
In my eyes right now,

01:03:19.589 --> 01:03:20.922
you're beautiful.

01:05:45.130 --> 01:05:46.130
Hey!

01:05:49.505 --> 01:05:50.547
Where are you going?

01:05:54.922 --> 01:05:56.047
What are you doing?

01:06:09.630 --> 01:06:10.714
Listen bro.

01:06:11.547 --> 01:06:14.214
I was so drunk last night,
so I was... a bit much.

01:06:14.505 --> 01:06:16.089
But I have to admit that...

01:06:16.797 --> 01:06:18.505
I like you just a little bit.

01:06:18.839 --> 01:06:21.339
However, I am clearly aware of
my background...

01:06:21.380 --> 01:06:22.964
No time for jokes.

01:06:23.339 --> 01:06:25.464
So you don't have to take
any responsibility,

01:06:25.755 --> 01:06:29.005
just consider it letting
me be naughty for one night.

01:06:29.047 --> 01:06:30.380
Are you dumping me?

01:06:31.589 --> 01:06:32.922
You can't do this to me.

01:06:33.547 --> 01:06:36.422
Do you know the impact last night's
gonna have on me for the rest of my life?

01:06:36.422 --> 01:06:38.172
- What impact?
- Huge.

01:06:38.547 --> 01:06:40.672
You're my girlfriend now.

01:06:40.922 --> 01:06:42.714
Be responsible for my life, please.

01:06:42.880 --> 01:06:44.630
Don't treat me like a one night stand.

01:06:44.880 --> 01:06:46.172
We're both adults.

01:06:46.505 --> 01:06:47.714
Be mature.

01:06:47.839 --> 01:06:49.839
- I mean...
- Stop shutting it down.

01:06:50.089 --> 01:06:51.214
Let's have breakfast.

01:06:51.255 --> 01:06:53.339
- Let's go.
- What breakfast...

01:06:53.464 --> 01:06:54.630
Breakfast or me?

01:06:55.089 --> 01:06:57.255
Stop saying things like that.

01:07:13.505 --> 01:07:14.755
There she said hi to us.
I heard it.

01:07:14.797 --> 01:07:16.422
- They're dating.
- I knew it.

01:07:16.464 --> 01:07:18.047
- Are they?
- Of course they are.

01:07:18.047 --> 01:07:19.297
Trust me.

01:07:25.964 --> 01:07:27.172
Can't you see?
They're leaving together.

01:07:27.297 --> 01:07:28.505
See?

01:07:28.589 --> 01:07:30.880
You guys are too damn nosy.

01:07:32.130 --> 01:07:33.297
Mind your own business.

01:07:33.297 --> 01:07:35.672
Just let them be a freaking couple!

01:07:43.839 --> 01:07:45.839
We'll talk again later.

01:07:46.047 --> 01:07:48.797
- He's trying to be her hero.
- What a show off!

01:07:48.839 --> 01:07:50.547
Good job buddy.

01:07:50.714 --> 01:07:52.672
You guys look fucking great together!

01:07:55.005 --> 01:07:56.172
How do you feel?

01:07:56.172 --> 01:07:57.380
Not bad.

01:07:59.922 --> 01:08:01.755
Is this enough force for you?

01:08:08.547 --> 01:08:09.797
- Go home, bye.
- Bye!

01:08:12.047 --> 01:08:13.297
- Stop that, Sau!
- Hey...

01:08:16.464 --> 01:08:17.714
Everything's sorted.
Let's get in.

01:08:17.755 --> 01:08:19.297
No way, get out!

01:08:21.880 --> 01:08:23.297
All clear! Go!

01:08:26.130 --> 01:08:27.172
Morning miss Nga.

01:08:27.922 --> 01:08:30.130
Nga, can you see
Duong just left from Mai's home?

01:08:30.172 --> 01:08:32.839
I'm not blind.
Go downstairs to get my dress!

01:08:32.880 --> 01:08:34.797
- It's so scary!
- No, you're so nosy!

01:08:36.255 --> 01:08:37.880
Someone sent you this keyboard.

01:08:40.172 --> 01:08:42.714
[For Binh Minh, from Duong.
Have fun.]

01:08:53.505 --> 01:08:54.922
Braised fish by Duong!

01:08:54.964 --> 01:08:56.089
Try it!

01:08:57.172 --> 01:08:58.922
- It stinks.
- Here's a shrimp.

01:08:59.797 --> 01:09:01.589
It's good, it's good.
Braised fish stinks naturally.

01:09:03.839 --> 01:09:05.339
- You're cheating.
- You're too good.

01:09:05.589 --> 01:09:07.005
How can anyone beat you bro?

01:09:47.297 --> 01:09:52.047
[It's hard to meet in this crowded world,
once you've come, please stay.]

01:09:58.714 --> 01:10:00.339
I'm not ready yet.

01:10:00.964 --> 01:10:02.547
Everything is moving so fast.

01:10:03.339 --> 01:10:05.339
It's like you're introducing me.

01:10:05.422 --> 01:10:07.630
Who said she can't see the future
when dating me?

01:10:07.922 --> 01:10:09.630
Now I'm taking you into the future

01:10:09.880 --> 01:10:11.297
and you're starting to shut it down again?

01:10:11.839 --> 01:10:13.630
- Are you serious?
- Very.

01:10:15.336 --> 01:10:17.505
- Really?
- Absolutely.

01:10:18.630 --> 01:10:20.714
Is this your house or a rental?
How can it be that big?

01:10:20.755 --> 01:10:22.297
How can I go in dressing like this?

01:10:23.339 --> 01:10:24.464
Your make-up is a bit over.

01:10:25.130 --> 01:10:26.589
Really?

01:10:27.172 --> 01:10:28.505
I thought so too.

01:10:28.547 --> 01:10:30.714
I paid 20 bucks for this shit.

01:10:30.922 --> 01:10:33.172
I told her to fix it but didn't have time,
now I have to fix it for sure.

01:10:33.172 --> 01:10:34.255
There's no time babe.

01:10:34.380 --> 01:10:37.047
Should I take the falsies off then?

01:10:37.255 --> 01:10:39.464
That would make it worse.

01:10:39.714 --> 01:10:41.839
Are you mocking me?

01:10:42.089 --> 01:10:43.297
You're cute.

01:10:43.714 --> 01:10:46.214
That attitude says it's not cute!

01:10:46.505 --> 01:10:48.464
- Tell the truth.
- Trust me.

01:10:48.755 --> 01:10:49.755
Tell me!

01:10:49.755 --> 01:10:50.797
You are cute.

01:10:51.130 --> 01:10:52.839
Now this bouquet is ugly too.

01:10:52.839 --> 01:10:54.547
- Where did you get it from?
- The make-up lady again...

01:10:54.547 --> 01:10:56.089
Sir, she's mad at you.

01:10:56.339 --> 01:10:57.839
Choose your words carefully.

01:11:00.214 --> 01:11:01.422
Good evening.

01:11:02.047 --> 01:11:03.714
Happy birthday to you.

01:11:03.880 --> 01:11:05.672
Nah, don't even kiss me.

01:11:05.839 --> 01:11:10.297
How can a son leave for that long
without visiting his parents?

01:11:10.797 --> 01:11:12.547
No no thank you.

01:11:12.672 --> 01:11:14.214
- Who is this?
- Good evening.

01:11:14.255 --> 01:11:15.422
- My girl.
- Oh.

01:11:15.589 --> 01:11:19.922
I have this flower for you,
happy birthday.

01:11:19.922 --> 01:11:21.422
You didn't have to.

01:11:21.505 --> 01:11:24.922
Take this flower away for me.

01:11:25.380 --> 01:11:26.922
Have a seat.

01:11:27.297 --> 01:11:28.672
These are all my friends.

01:11:28.714 --> 01:11:30.964
Good evening everyone.

01:11:32.047 --> 01:11:34.672
- What's your name?
- My name's Mai.

01:11:35.255 --> 01:11:36.755
You're the one and only,

01:11:36.922 --> 01:11:38.255
never another one,

01:11:38.255 --> 01:11:41.339
he has never taken anyone home before.

01:11:42.505 --> 01:11:44.464
What's your job?

01:11:44.714 --> 01:11:47.589
- I am...
- She provides physiotherapy.

01:11:48.505 --> 01:11:49.714
I'm a masseuse.

01:11:50.255 --> 01:11:51.380
What?

01:11:51.547 --> 01:11:53.047
I give massages.

01:11:53.130 --> 01:11:54.464
A masseuse?

01:11:55.172 --> 01:11:56.589
How old are you?

01:11:57.172 --> 01:11:58.630
I'm thirty-seven.

01:11:58.672 --> 01:11:59.839
What?

01:11:59.839 --> 01:12:01.255
A masseuse,

01:12:01.422 --> 01:12:04.755
and it's late to not have a family
at thirty-seven.

01:12:05.047 --> 01:12:06.505
I have a daughter.

01:12:06.964 --> 01:12:08.130
What?

01:12:08.130 --> 01:12:09.464
A masseuse,

01:12:09.755 --> 01:12:11.172
thirty-seven,

01:12:11.672 --> 01:12:12.839
one child.

01:12:14.005 --> 01:12:15.505
Anything else?

01:12:15.880 --> 01:12:17.297
Let's stop with the questions and eat.

01:12:17.339 --> 01:12:19.672
- Let me talk to her.
- Let's eat.

01:12:19.797 --> 01:12:22.172
Where do you work?

01:12:22.172 --> 01:12:23.880
Ima Koko in district 3.

01:12:25.630 --> 01:12:27.672
The one I keep wanting to take you.

01:12:29.214 --> 01:12:31.547
Mom, I miss you so much.

01:12:32.380 --> 01:12:34.255
Really? I thought you forgot all about me.

01:12:34.339 --> 01:12:36.422
- How can I?
- Why are you so skinny?

01:12:36.547 --> 01:12:37.630
I've been on a diet.

01:12:38.797 --> 01:12:40.755
- Taking the day off today?
- Yeah.

01:12:42.922 --> 01:12:44.130
You know each other?

01:12:44.172 --> 01:12:46.589
I'm a VIP client, she has
worked on me for a while.

01:12:47.797 --> 01:12:49.339
You two got the same masseuse?

01:12:49.339 --> 01:12:50.547
- That's great!
- Hey!

01:12:50.589 --> 01:12:51.880
Stop teasing me!

01:12:52.422 --> 01:12:54.422
Why do I never see you there?

01:12:54.797 --> 01:12:56.297
We're probably in different areas.

01:12:56.672 --> 01:13:00.214
Plus you probably have tunnel vision
going in there.

01:13:00.880 --> 01:13:02.672
Sorry for coming down late.

01:13:02.714 --> 01:13:03.797
Let's cheers!

01:13:03.839 --> 01:13:07.089
What day is it today that
no one is congratulating me?

01:13:07.797 --> 01:13:10.255
She's my aunt, mom's sister,

01:13:10.297 --> 01:13:13.214
she raised me, her name is Mi,
so I call her MaMi.

01:13:13.339 --> 01:13:14.547
Oh, and...

01:13:14.672 --> 01:13:16.130
I'm Sau's mom.

01:13:18.130 --> 01:13:19.297
Surprise!

01:13:20.547 --> 01:13:22.005
Cheers everyone!

01:13:22.005 --> 01:13:24.839
- Sister!
- Thank you, thank you.

01:13:24.880 --> 01:13:26.714
- Let's get drunk.
- Oh, okay.

01:13:26.797 --> 01:13:30.380
- Drink with me.
- One, two, three, cheers!

01:13:30.672 --> 01:13:32.672
Happy birthday sis!

01:13:34.380 --> 01:13:37.005
Let's sing! 2,3, go!

01:14:02.630 --> 01:14:04.005
Cheers!

01:14:04.422 --> 01:14:05.589
Come on girl, cheers!

01:15:57.880 --> 01:16:02.005
In the name of the Father, the Son,
and the Holy Spirits. Amen.

01:16:23.380 --> 01:16:24.422
Did you wait for long?

01:16:24.922 --> 01:16:26.047
Sorry.

01:16:28.172 --> 01:16:29.214
Gosh.

01:16:29.464 --> 01:16:30.922
I don't know how to treat you now.

01:16:31.922 --> 01:16:33.714
Are you my sister or my son's girl?

01:16:35.839 --> 01:16:37.047
Let's go with sisters.

01:16:40.505 --> 01:16:43.714
You wanted to meet me here because
you don't believe what I'm gonna say?

01:16:43.839 --> 01:16:47.547
No, I'm afraid you won't believe
what I'm gonna say.

01:16:50.672 --> 01:16:54.130
You guys started dating
since you confided in me?

01:16:54.797 --> 01:16:55.880
Does he love you?

01:16:58.422 --> 01:16:59.672
Do you love him?

01:17:00.172 --> 01:17:01.214
Oops!

01:17:01.672 --> 01:17:02.797
So impolite.

01:17:04.589 --> 01:17:07.422
We have the same masseuse for months

01:17:07.755 --> 01:17:09.297
and neither of us know.

01:17:10.380 --> 01:17:11.547
Oh my gosh!

01:17:18.005 --> 01:17:19.214
Let's talk.

01:17:20.130 --> 01:17:22.380
Don't think I'm meeting you to stop you.

01:17:22.839 --> 01:17:23.964
I'm open.

01:17:24.172 --> 01:17:25.172
Keep faling in love.

01:17:25.464 --> 01:17:26.630
It's love...

01:17:26.672 --> 01:17:27.797
No one can stop it.

01:17:30.172 --> 01:17:31.797
But let's think it over.

01:17:32.214 --> 01:17:35.172
I'm talking to you as your sister,

01:17:35.422 --> 01:17:36.755
not Duong's mother.

01:17:38.589 --> 01:17:39.880
I'm a single mom,

01:17:41.005 --> 01:17:43.589
I understand everything that
a single mom goes through.

01:17:44.797 --> 01:17:46.547
In front of God here,
I'll be honest

01:17:46.839 --> 01:17:52.297
I always want you to have a nice, decent
and wealthy man that can take care of you.

01:17:53.172 --> 01:17:56.214
I just never thought it would be my son.

01:17:56.922 --> 01:17:58.505
Do you know why I call him Sau (worm)?

01:17:59.255 --> 01:18:00.505
Because to me

01:18:00.672 --> 01:18:02.630
he always lives in his cocoon.

01:18:03.380 --> 01:18:07.880
He's twenty-nine and is still
spending his mommy's money.

01:18:08.380 --> 01:18:09.839
He's a worm at home,

01:18:09.922 --> 01:18:13.214
but outside, he's a free butterfly
with his love life.

01:18:13.380 --> 01:18:15.797
Moving from one flower to another.

01:18:17.047 --> 01:18:19.047
You don't think you're suffering enough?

01:18:19.755 --> 01:18:20.880
Your shoulders...

01:18:21.547 --> 01:18:22.630
carrying your father,

01:18:23.172 --> 01:18:24.255
Binh Minh,

01:18:24.505 --> 01:18:26.047
all the clients at work...

01:18:26.255 --> 01:18:29.214
Now you want to carry my irresonsible son?

01:18:29.422 --> 01:18:31.005
Are you a weight-lifter?

01:18:36.839 --> 01:18:40.047
I've learnt through my years
that life is unfair.

01:18:41.005 --> 01:18:43.214
Men can mess up dozens of times.

01:18:43.297 --> 01:18:45.797
They can still restart their
lives at six, seventy years old.

01:18:46.922 --> 01:18:47.964
As for you,

01:18:48.255 --> 01:18:51.714
if you mess up again at this age
that will be the end of it.

01:18:51.755 --> 01:18:55.255
Remember the reason why you didn't
want to work for me?

01:18:55.297 --> 01:18:59.089
You said friendships would take a toll
when money is involved,

01:18:59.547 --> 01:19:00.630
then let me ask you,

01:19:01.922 --> 01:19:03.297
if one day

01:19:04.464 --> 01:19:07.005
my son breaks your heart,

01:19:08.339 --> 01:19:10.547
how can I ever look at you again?

01:19:22.880 --> 01:19:24.047
Do you...

01:19:24.214 --> 01:19:26.589
Do you understand what I'm saying?

01:19:27.339 --> 01:19:29.172
- I mean...
- Sis...

01:19:30.047 --> 01:19:31.214
I got it.

01:19:37.214 --> 01:19:38.547
- Here, let me...
- Hey hey!

01:19:38.797 --> 01:19:40.630
- Mai!
- Let me return this necklace to you.

01:19:40.672 --> 01:19:42.339
This was my gift for you.

01:19:42.380 --> 01:19:44.505
I'm not taking it back.

01:19:44.547 --> 01:19:46.339
- Mai!
- Please take it back.

01:19:47.922 --> 01:19:49.339
Just like you said,

01:19:50.422 --> 01:19:52.047
I'm a mother as well,

01:19:52.464 --> 01:19:54.089
I understand.

01:19:54.380 --> 01:19:55.714
Don't worry.

01:19:56.672 --> 01:19:58.255
I know what I have to do.

01:19:59.297 --> 01:20:00.339
No.

01:20:00.505 --> 01:20:02.589
Don't say what you "have to" do.

01:20:03.047 --> 01:20:04.797
I hope you can realize

01:20:05.130 --> 01:20:07.089
what you "should" do.

01:20:08.255 --> 01:20:10.589
You're doing this for yourself,
not for me.

01:20:14.714 --> 01:20:15.839
I see.

01:20:15.880 --> 01:20:18.839
- Please take this back though.
- Mai!

01:20:19.547 --> 01:20:20.630
It's mine.

01:20:25.130 --> 01:20:26.214
What?

01:20:26.297 --> 01:20:27.380
Hello?

01:20:27.839 --> 01:20:29.797
- You'll scare the customers away.
- Don't worry.

01:20:29.797 --> 01:20:31.422
- What is it?
- Calm down, we'll just talk.

01:20:31.880 --> 01:20:32.880
Mom.

01:20:33.005 --> 01:20:35.089
He's done it again.
They're fussing now.

01:20:35.297 --> 01:20:36.464
I'm not fussing.

01:20:37.672 --> 01:20:38.672
Again?

01:20:39.464 --> 01:20:40.547
And this is Mai?

01:20:41.922 --> 01:20:43.130
Is she?

01:20:44.047 --> 01:20:44.964
Let's go outside...

01:20:44.964 --> 01:20:47.464
How much does he owe you?
I'll settle it outside.

01:20:47.464 --> 01:20:49.172
This is my sister's place, don't do this.

01:20:50.172 --> 01:20:51.922
She asked how much, answer.

01:20:54.505 --> 01:20:55.672
Don't be so silent.

01:20:57.672 --> 01:20:59.255
- Talk.
- How much?

01:20:59.547 --> 01:21:01.089
- Twenty-one.
- What?

01:21:01.589 --> 01:21:02.672
Twenty-one thousand?

01:21:03.047 --> 01:21:04.547
Well it's certainly not twenty bucks.

01:21:04.672 --> 01:21:05.880
Are you kidding me?

01:21:08.172 --> 01:21:09.255
What now?

01:21:09.547 --> 01:21:11.214
What a quiet place!

01:21:11.255 --> 01:21:14.047
- Can we please solve this outside?
- Fine.

01:21:14.464 --> 01:21:15.464
Here.

01:21:15.922 --> 01:21:17.464
Take twenty-one hundred as deposit.

01:21:17.547 --> 01:21:19.422
Call me and I'll settle the rest.

01:21:20.130 --> 01:21:21.880
Why didn't you tell me you have a sponsor?

01:21:22.047 --> 01:21:23.089
Boss!

01:21:23.297 --> 01:21:25.422
- Please help me settle this.
- I'm not new to this.

01:21:25.505 --> 01:21:26.797
- Leave.
- Got it.

01:21:26.880 --> 01:21:28.255
Nice coffee!

01:21:28.755 --> 01:21:29.964
Make way for me.

01:21:30.130 --> 01:21:32.547
I thought you were the shit,
turns out my boss is much better.

01:21:32.797 --> 01:21:34.297
Stop running away from me.

01:21:35.005 --> 01:21:36.005
What?

01:21:36.297 --> 01:21:37.505
Why are you so late?

01:21:41.297 --> 01:21:43.714
I'll take care of your father's affair.

01:21:44.797 --> 01:21:45.922
Go home.

01:21:46.672 --> 01:21:48.964
How can you fall in love
with such a troublesome family?

01:21:50.047 --> 01:21:51.464
No no, this money...

01:21:52.547 --> 01:21:53.672
I'll pay you back.

01:21:55.297 --> 01:21:57.339
Father, let's go home and talk this out.

01:21:58.047 --> 01:22:00.797
Minh, help me clean this up.

01:22:01.505 --> 01:22:02.547
Dad!

01:22:02.547 --> 01:22:03.630
Let's go.

01:22:06.672 --> 01:22:07.755
- Mai.
- Thank you.

01:22:07.755 --> 01:22:09.005
Clean this up for me.

01:22:09.297 --> 01:22:10.547
I'm sorry.

01:22:11.339 --> 01:22:12.339
Two taels of gold,

01:22:12.380 --> 01:22:13.797
and ten grand,

01:22:15.130 --> 01:22:16.214
that's all that I have.

01:22:16.630 --> 01:22:17.714
Take them all.

01:22:20.005 --> 01:22:21.130
- Listen to...
- Take them.

01:22:21.130 --> 01:22:22.880
Take them all and keep on gambling.

01:22:22.922 --> 01:22:24.339
It's not that, listen to me.

01:22:24.380 --> 01:22:26.505
Don't ever come back into my life again.

01:22:31.714 --> 01:22:32.880
That was harsh.

01:22:32.880 --> 01:22:34.880
And all the things you've
done to my life are not?

01:22:35.130 --> 01:22:37.422
You don't use your head to think.

01:22:38.172 --> 01:22:39.880
How can you be this cruel to me?

01:22:40.255 --> 01:22:44.339
I thought everytime I pay your debt,
you'd stop out of love for me.

01:22:44.922 --> 01:22:46.130
But there's no limit to you.

01:22:47.589 --> 01:22:49.922
I just really want to help you.

01:22:49.964 --> 01:22:51.005
Take this.

01:22:51.297 --> 01:22:52.547
- Take all of this.
- Listen...

01:22:52.589 --> 01:22:57.214
I'm begging you, leave me alone,
I can't take this anymore.

01:22:58.089 --> 01:22:59.880
I cannot take this anymore.

01:23:06.922 --> 01:23:08.005
Mai.

01:23:08.339 --> 01:23:09.422
Why are you crying?

01:23:09.922 --> 01:23:11.297
What's happening?

01:23:11.839 --> 01:23:13.547
You've been avoiding me
ever since we met mom.

01:23:13.547 --> 01:23:16.130
- Go home, I'm in the midd...
- How can I go home?

01:23:16.672 --> 01:23:18.214
You didn't pick up my calls.

01:23:18.922 --> 01:23:20.005
I'm your boyfriend,

01:23:20.047 --> 01:23:22.130
I have the right to know
what's going on with you.

01:23:24.005 --> 01:23:26.464
- What was that at the shop?
- Done with the questions?

01:23:26.547 --> 01:23:28.130
I want to know what mom said to you.

01:23:28.130 --> 01:23:30.672
I said I don't want to talk right now,
just leave.

01:23:30.714 --> 01:23:32.547
At least let me know what you want.

01:23:35.589 --> 01:23:36.797
I want to break up.

01:23:38.422 --> 01:23:39.547
What are you talking about?

01:23:46.714 --> 01:23:47.755
Talk to me.

01:23:48.547 --> 01:23:51.755
Tell me, tell me what's wrong
so I can find a solution.

01:23:51.880 --> 01:23:53.214
Don't shut me out.

01:23:55.339 --> 01:23:56.964
Okay. Come here.

01:23:59.339 --> 01:24:00.380
Here.

01:24:00.380 --> 01:24:01.464
My father.

01:24:01.505 --> 01:24:03.172
A man who loves money.

01:24:03.964 --> 01:24:06.422
He owes the gangster more than
twenty grands in gambling debt.

01:24:07.047 --> 01:24:08.130
Take care of that.

01:24:08.422 --> 01:24:09.755
And my daughter,

01:24:09.755 --> 01:24:11.380
who has dropped out
of school for months,

01:24:11.380 --> 01:24:14.464
trying to make a living where your mom
is paying her, solve that as well.

01:24:15.297 --> 01:24:17.505
And then there's me, this old hag,

01:24:17.547 --> 01:24:21.005
I'm have to work as a masseuse
to make a living everyday,

01:24:21.005 --> 01:24:22.964
take care of that for me too.

01:24:24.464 --> 01:24:25.547
So what?

01:24:26.297 --> 01:24:27.672
You wanted to know.

01:24:28.047 --> 01:24:29.589
Well there ya go.

01:24:30.422 --> 01:24:32.964
You knew fuck all about me.

01:24:33.755 --> 01:24:34.839
Enough Mai.

01:24:37.089 --> 01:24:38.130
That's enough.

01:24:39.297 --> 01:24:40.505
What? Not used to this?

01:24:42.255 --> 01:24:43.547
It's me.

01:24:44.755 --> 01:24:48.672
I should've told you, showed you
my true self from the start.

01:24:49.339 --> 01:24:50.797
Because I'm uneducated.

01:24:51.089 --> 01:24:52.964
There was no one to teach me.

01:25:00.797 --> 01:25:01.922
Your mom was right.

01:25:03.547 --> 01:25:05.714
You can't do anything without money.

01:25:09.922 --> 01:25:11.422
You said you will take care of me,

01:25:12.089 --> 01:25:13.339
how?

01:25:14.047 --> 01:25:16.214
How can you when I
make more money than you?

01:25:32.172 --> 01:25:33.464
What did you say to Mai?

01:25:34.630 --> 01:25:36.047
Who are you raising your voice at?

01:25:36.922 --> 01:25:38.130
I'm sorry.

01:25:38.214 --> 01:25:39.839
But I want to know what you said to her!

01:25:39.880 --> 01:25:41.422
I said what I needed to say.

01:25:43.339 --> 01:25:44.464
Okay.

01:25:44.505 --> 01:25:45.797
I know you look down on her.

01:25:45.839 --> 01:25:47.339
- I don't.
- It's okay.

01:25:47.714 --> 01:25:49.589
But I want to know that
deep down in your heart

01:25:49.589 --> 01:25:50.964
you know she's a good person, right?

01:25:51.005 --> 01:25:52.297
I don't deny that.

01:25:52.422 --> 01:25:53.714
She is a very good person,

01:25:54.005 --> 01:25:56.422
for any man, but you.

01:25:56.922 --> 01:25:58.047
Why?

01:25:59.089 --> 01:26:00.130
Why?

01:26:01.339 --> 01:26:02.672
What are you gonna do for her?

01:26:03.214 --> 01:26:04.672
Have you seen her family?

01:26:05.047 --> 01:26:06.297
Her dad's neck deep in debt,

01:26:06.464 --> 01:26:08.255
her daughter's barely educated,

01:26:08.422 --> 01:26:09.464
with an undefined gender.

01:26:09.464 --> 01:26:11.464
- Don't say that.
- I mean it.

01:26:13.339 --> 01:26:15.464
Are you trying to be the knight in
shining armor?

01:26:16.047 --> 01:26:17.255
Have a look at yourself!

01:26:17.422 --> 01:26:18.505
Do you have a job?

01:26:18.880 --> 01:26:21.130
Name your career.

01:26:21.214 --> 01:26:22.339
A composer?

01:26:23.005 --> 01:26:24.547
A street performer?

01:26:25.130 --> 01:26:26.464
You refused to live in a house like this

01:26:26.547 --> 01:26:28.630
to live in an apartment for
"life material".

01:26:28.922 --> 01:26:30.547
Have you composed any song?

01:26:30.547 --> 01:26:32.589
Have you ever contributed financially?

01:26:32.880 --> 01:26:36.422
You can only play the piano,
and in my own restaurant might I add.

01:26:37.130 --> 01:26:39.630
Not a cent to your name
and you want to be Hercules?

01:26:40.005 --> 01:26:41.130
Stupid!

01:26:43.880 --> 01:26:45.505
All of this is about money?

01:26:45.547 --> 01:26:47.714
Maybe money is not important to you.

01:26:47.797 --> 01:26:49.047
But without money

01:26:49.089 --> 01:26:50.630
you can't do any freaking thing.

01:26:53.005 --> 01:26:54.214
To be more specific,

01:26:54.380 --> 01:26:55.672
without my money,

01:26:55.755 --> 01:26:57.214
you can't do shit.

01:26:57.755 --> 01:26:59.630
I've done all of this for you.

01:27:00.214 --> 01:27:02.630
No, you did this for you.

01:27:17.297 --> 01:27:18.672
If I did it for me,

01:27:19.422 --> 01:27:20.880
I would've gotten married long ago.

01:27:21.005 --> 01:27:23.297
And I'd only care about my own happiness.

01:27:25.630 --> 01:27:28.630
I've spent all these years alone, for who?

01:27:30.047 --> 01:27:32.255
I've driven so many people away

01:27:32.297 --> 01:27:34.839
out of fear that they will not
love my son, for who?

01:27:35.464 --> 01:27:38.839
I've sacrificed my youth and
worked like a slave

01:27:38.839 --> 01:27:40.922
so my son can live like a prince, for who?

01:27:41.172 --> 01:27:42.880
Give me back my youth.

01:27:50.589 --> 01:27:51.922
I wish you could.

01:27:51.964 --> 01:27:53.839
How? It's too late!

01:27:53.880 --> 01:27:54.964
Sorry mom.

01:27:55.380 --> 01:27:57.714
I've never asked you to give me your youth.

01:27:58.422 --> 01:28:00.422
I always wanted you to have
a special someone.

01:28:00.755 --> 01:28:02.505
I've always wanted you to live your...

01:28:02.505 --> 01:28:03.880
- You just don't understand.
- Mom!

01:28:04.172 --> 01:28:06.422
I never wanted you to live alone,

01:28:06.464 --> 01:28:09.505
to suffer everything then turn around
and said that it's all for me.

01:28:09.547 --> 01:28:11.047
Live your life, mom.

01:28:15.297 --> 01:28:16.339
Okay.

01:28:17.297 --> 01:28:18.797
Okay.

01:28:35.130 --> 01:28:36.172
Mom...

01:28:42.922 --> 01:28:44.672
You'll always be a worm.

01:28:45.839 --> 01:28:47.380
Always.

01:28:58.505 --> 01:29:00.297
Do you know why I don't want to
work for you

01:29:00.380 --> 01:29:01.797
and move out?

01:29:03.464 --> 01:29:04.964
Because in the end, a worm

01:29:06.630 --> 01:29:08.047
will turn into a butterfly.

01:29:12.880 --> 01:29:15.797
Leave all your bank cards then
be a butterfly as you want.

01:29:26.005 --> 01:29:27.089
Sorry mom.

01:30:07.255 --> 01:30:08.464
This is your last week pay.

01:30:08.797 --> 01:30:09.922
What?

01:30:12.297 --> 01:30:13.422
She called me.

01:30:15.547 --> 01:30:16.630
Take this.

01:30:18.172 --> 01:30:19.214
Good job, bro.

01:30:20.422 --> 01:30:21.464
Hey!

01:30:22.047 --> 01:30:24.005
I know you'd be upset, but you gotta know

01:30:24.214 --> 01:30:26.005
you're my friend, she's my boss.

01:30:26.755 --> 01:30:28.922
- If I don't fire you, she'll get me fired.
- I know.

01:30:29.255 --> 01:30:30.797
- Duong!
- It's okay.

01:30:30.880 --> 01:30:32.380
You don't seem to understand me bro.

01:30:32.922 --> 01:30:34.005
Duong!

01:30:38.047 --> 01:30:39.339
[Job Application]

01:30:39.755 --> 01:30:41.214
You've gotta move next month.

01:30:42.339 --> 01:30:43.797
I paid in full.

01:30:43.797 --> 01:30:45.922
Yeah, you paid.

01:30:46.089 --> 01:30:47.755
But someone else paid fuller.

01:30:48.047 --> 01:30:49.797
This unit is paid for for a whole year.

01:30:59.380 --> 01:31:00.380
Where are you?

01:31:02.047 --> 01:31:03.255
Gosh damn it.

01:31:03.297 --> 01:31:04.255
No.

01:31:04.297 --> 01:31:05.589
Slow down.

01:31:06.562 --> 01:31:07.646
Relax your hand!

01:31:07.646 --> 01:31:08.937
Hey! Don't touch my son!

01:31:08.979 --> 01:31:11.485
- Mom, it hurts!
- Come here baby!

01:31:11.526 --> 01:31:13.838
- I... I'm so sorry because...
- Go home. No more studying.

01:31:13.920 --> 01:31:14.787
Go!

01:31:14.905 --> 01:31:15.717
Ok.

01:31:16.489 --> 01:31:17.436
Sorry

01:31:17.604 --> 01:31:19.211
You'd better do something.

01:31:19.797 --> 01:31:22.339
Are you just gonna leave him like that?

01:31:22.505 --> 01:31:24.255
Let him be. He chose this.

01:31:24.547 --> 01:31:26.255
I'll just think he's a nobody.

01:31:26.255 --> 01:31:27.964
How can you say that?

01:31:28.005 --> 01:31:29.589
I'm in no mood. I quit.

01:31:29.630 --> 01:31:31.214
The family is in distress.

01:31:31.922 --> 01:31:33.672
Tham, take me outside.

01:31:58.589 --> 01:31:59.880
Get some sleep!

01:32:00.797 --> 01:32:02.172
Stop texting her.

01:32:02.630 --> 01:32:04.005
You're in too deep.

01:32:07.047 --> 01:32:08.880
How can you sleep
drinking coffee at this hour?

01:32:09.380 --> 01:32:11.005
Drink some ginger tea.

01:32:12.505 --> 01:32:13.797
Give me your leg.

01:32:13.922 --> 01:32:15.630
- Stop...
- Come on.

01:32:16.547 --> 01:32:18.130
Let me give a masseuse a masage.

01:32:21.422 --> 01:32:23.005
I'll move here tomorrow.

01:32:23.339 --> 01:32:25.589
Just let grandpa be, he's unchangable.

01:32:25.755 --> 01:32:27.005
Don't be sad.

01:32:43.797 --> 01:32:45.214
Sorry, sorry.

01:32:46.047 --> 01:32:47.422
See accountant to get your last paycheck.

01:32:47.464 --> 01:32:48.672
What's wrong?

01:32:48.714 --> 01:32:49.589
My songs are not good?

01:32:49.589 --> 01:32:52.005
You're so good that my customers can't eat.

01:32:52.047 --> 01:32:55.214
My restaurant needs some relaxing music,

01:32:55.380 --> 01:32:57.255
not a masterpiece meant for an orchestra.

01:32:57.255 --> 01:32:58.547
People need to eat!

01:32:59.630 --> 01:33:01.547
Now you're having an attitude?

01:33:01.839 --> 01:33:05.089
It was hard for anyone to maintain
a business after Covid,

01:33:05.172 --> 01:33:07.297
give me a chance to do it longer.

01:33:07.380 --> 01:33:08.589
Come in.

01:33:09.797 --> 01:33:11.380
You don't have to pay me today. Thanks.

01:33:12.172 --> 01:33:13.672
Such a big ego!

01:33:16.672 --> 01:33:18.005
Come in.

01:33:18.047 --> 01:33:19.672
Hurry up, I have things to do.

01:33:19.672 --> 01:33:21.214
Remember, soft and tenderly.

01:33:21.255 --> 01:33:22.880
People need to eat.

01:33:22.880 --> 01:33:24.630
Don't play any masterpiece, okay?

01:33:31.047 --> 01:33:32.297
Duong!

01:33:37.672 --> 01:33:39.755
Don't think too much
about what my mom said.

01:33:41.255 --> 01:33:43.839
She wanted to be mean so
you'd break up with her.

01:33:44.505 --> 01:33:47.297
I've been her daughter and her husband
long enough to know this.

01:33:48.297 --> 01:33:50.422
She just looks tough on the outside,

01:33:50.422 --> 01:33:52.089
while she really yearns for love.

01:33:53.672 --> 01:33:55.922
I haven't seen her smile for a long time.

01:33:57.505 --> 01:33:59.505
The last time she was happy

01:34:01.047 --> 01:34:02.839
was when you were around.

01:34:06.130 --> 01:34:07.214
Be patient!

01:34:08.422 --> 01:34:09.672
Don't give up.

01:34:10.630 --> 01:34:12.214
Help her get a boyfriend.

01:34:14.172 --> 01:34:15.255
Back to work now.

01:34:18.922 --> 01:34:19.964
Minh!

01:34:22.630 --> 01:34:23.839
Do your best!

01:34:28.922 --> 01:34:29.714
Mai!

01:34:30.422 --> 01:34:32.047
Why do you keep seducing my husband?

01:34:32.089 --> 01:34:34.547
So many men here and you
just had to pick my husband?

01:34:34.672 --> 01:34:36.797
Tell me what you want you damn whore!

01:34:36.797 --> 01:34:38.964
Have you had a look at your husband
before asking?

01:34:39.089 --> 01:34:40.839
How dare you?
I'll slap the shit out of you!

01:34:40.880 --> 01:34:42.005
I'm talking to you bitch.

01:34:42.047 --> 01:34:45.214
- Stop, don't fight here.
- Why are you walking away from me?

01:34:45.672 --> 01:34:48.297
Go be a hooker somewhere else.

01:34:48.297 --> 01:34:51.672
Ever since you rented out to her,
the whole place is disturbed.

01:34:51.714 --> 01:34:52.880
Come on, shut up!

01:34:52.922 --> 01:34:55.547
It sounds like I have to kick her out,
is that what you mean?

01:34:55.547 --> 01:34:57.630
If it was me, I'd slap them for sure.

01:34:58.005 --> 01:34:59.214
I wouldn't let it slide.

01:34:59.422 --> 01:35:00.964
You've gotta live your life babe.

01:35:00.964 --> 01:35:02.755
The whole building said I'm a hooker,

01:35:03.339 --> 01:35:06.047
but I'm not, even though
I absolutely look like one.

01:35:08.172 --> 01:35:10.005
Being a woman is already a misfortune,

01:35:10.464 --> 01:35:12.422
try and live this life happily.

01:35:12.505 --> 01:35:14.505
You'd never know what you'll be
in the next life.

01:35:29.130 --> 01:35:31.547
[I'm getting paid today.
I'm trying my best.]

01:35:31.547 --> 01:35:34.255
[I won't let you down.
Give me more time. Miss you.]

01:35:37.672 --> 01:35:38.839
Mai!

01:35:41.130 --> 01:35:43.214
Fuck you, you snitched so Tu'd fire me?

01:35:43.255 --> 01:35:44.880
I don't know what you're saying.
I didn't.

01:35:44.922 --> 01:35:46.422
It must have been her.

01:35:46.422 --> 01:35:48.130
- What's wrong Trinh?
- Shut up, fuck off!

01:35:49.380 --> 01:35:50.839
Who else can it be?

01:35:51.255 --> 01:35:53.089
I don't want to talk to you in this state.

01:35:54.339 --> 01:35:55.547
How dare you deny it?

01:35:56.339 --> 01:35:57.880
You're pretending you didn't do it?

01:35:57.880 --> 01:36:00.839
I told you I wanted to beat you up
from the start.

01:36:00.922 --> 01:36:03.089
I haven't even touched you,
and you messed with me.

01:36:03.130 --> 01:36:06.380
Well you messed with the wrong person.

01:36:10.755 --> 01:36:12.589
How much do they have to pay
for you to open your mouth?

01:36:12.630 --> 01:36:14.880
- I know what you do. How much?
- She's a whore for sure.

01:36:14.922 --> 01:36:16.880
- She's a sugar baby for sure.
- Have you seen her eyebrows?

01:36:17.005 --> 01:36:20.880
Can you pretend to be worse
so we can make a living?

01:36:54.672 --> 01:36:56.047
You're only prettier than me.

01:36:56.047 --> 01:36:57.130
Do you have a boyfriend?

01:36:57.130 --> 01:36:58.255
How dare you seduce my husband?

01:36:58.422 --> 01:37:00.005
- I like you.
- Such a whore!

01:37:00.005 --> 01:37:02.339
How much do they have to pay
for you to open your mouth?

01:37:09.797 --> 01:37:10.880
Fight.

01:37:20.922 --> 01:37:22.214
I said I didn't do it.

01:37:22.255 --> 01:37:25.130
Why do you you keep fighting me?

01:37:25.172 --> 01:37:26.880
How dare you hit her?

01:37:30.130 --> 01:37:31.797
I've let you live for too long.

01:37:33.922 --> 01:37:35.089
Tu!

01:37:35.422 --> 01:37:36.589
Tu!

01:37:38.339 --> 01:37:39.922
Mai! What the heck?

01:37:51.005 --> 01:37:52.630
Mai! Mai!

01:37:52.630 --> 01:37:53.839
Mai! Stop!

01:38:09.214 --> 01:38:10.339
I said

01:38:10.672 --> 01:38:12.047
I didn't do it.

01:38:22.172 --> 01:38:24.505
Why do I have to harm you?
Who do you think you are?

01:38:24.547 --> 01:38:27.005
It's you. You're the one harming me,
you hear me?

01:38:27.047 --> 01:38:28.547
- Mai!
- You hear me?

01:38:29.089 --> 01:38:30.880
Why didn't you guys stop them?

01:38:32.255 --> 01:38:33.380
Mai!

01:38:34.464 --> 01:38:35.672
Mai!

01:38:36.672 --> 01:38:38.422
This is a business,
not where you can fight.

01:38:38.422 --> 01:38:39.714
- She's gone insane.
- Shut up.

01:38:40.255 --> 01:38:41.422
- She started...
- Shut it.

01:38:42.047 --> 01:38:43.630
Explain in the management office.

01:38:44.422 --> 01:38:45.672
I'm sorry.

01:38:46.130 --> 01:38:47.297
It's all okay.

01:38:47.297 --> 01:38:49.672
Just a misunderstanding! Please go ahead!

01:38:49.755 --> 01:38:50.839
Tu!

01:38:52.172 --> 01:38:53.380
I quit.

01:38:54.630 --> 01:38:56.172
- Mai!
- Mai!

01:38:56.297 --> 01:38:57.630
It's okay everyone.

01:38:57.880 --> 01:38:59.172
Please continue.

01:38:59.880 --> 01:39:01.297
Someone stop Mai!

01:39:01.672 --> 01:39:04.089
Mai!

01:39:10.172 --> 01:39:11.380
Did you get in a fight?

01:39:16.630 --> 01:39:17.839
Are you okay?

01:39:23.339 --> 01:39:24.714
What did you

01:39:25.047 --> 01:39:26.547
call me here for?

01:39:29.964 --> 01:39:31.422
If you don't want to talk,

01:39:31.922 --> 01:39:33.255
then let me do the talking first.

01:39:40.005 --> 01:39:41.130
A gift.

01:39:42.630 --> 01:39:44.005
Why?

01:39:44.714 --> 01:39:45.922
Because I want to.

01:39:46.672 --> 01:39:49.505
I bought this with my own money,

01:39:49.672 --> 01:39:51.172
not my mom's.

01:39:52.630 --> 01:39:54.089
Can I put it on for you?

01:40:00.339 --> 01:40:01.464
So pretty.

01:40:04.797 --> 01:40:06.130
This is for savings.

01:40:06.547 --> 01:40:07.797
Only an ounce.

01:40:08.047 --> 01:40:09.297
It's not much.

01:40:09.339 --> 01:40:11.005
When I make more money,

01:40:11.422 --> 01:40:12.672
I'll give you a tael.

01:40:15.172 --> 01:40:16.672
Give me some time.

01:40:19.880 --> 01:40:21.714
So because of these,

01:40:23.964 --> 01:40:25.630
you turn into that?

01:40:37.380 --> 01:40:39.255
You were so happy.

01:40:41.255 --> 01:40:43.714
Why do you have to suffer
for a girl like me?

01:40:45.380 --> 01:40:47.089
You're stupid, Sau.

01:40:48.630 --> 01:40:50.464
No one is wise when in love.

01:40:58.422 --> 01:40:59.505
Go.

01:41:05.339 --> 01:41:06.547
I'll head out.

01:41:08.089 --> 01:41:09.089
Sau!

01:41:09.547 --> 01:41:11.464
I don't think you're that stupid.

01:41:12.130 --> 01:41:13.755
I meant let's go.

01:41:14.047 --> 01:41:15.047
Where?

01:41:15.130 --> 01:41:16.172
Anywhere.

01:41:16.797 --> 01:41:18.964
To a place where no one knows us.

01:41:19.255 --> 01:41:22.089
It doesn't matter if we're poor
and life is hard,

01:41:22.922 --> 01:41:24.755
I just want to be in love.

01:41:25.214 --> 01:41:27.464
I'm almost forty.

01:41:34.047 --> 01:41:35.255
Le Trung Duong!

01:41:36.589 --> 01:41:37.755
Do you love me?

01:41:38.964 --> 01:41:40.339
Do I need to answer that?

01:41:40.672 --> 01:41:41.714
Then promise me.

01:41:43.130 --> 01:41:44.755
Don't ever leave me!

01:41:46.047 --> 01:41:47.464
I'll try my best!

01:41:53.297 --> 01:41:55.172
You scared me!

01:41:55.422 --> 01:41:57.005
So what? Hate me!

01:41:58.255 --> 01:41:59.464
Where's the ring?

01:42:01.422 --> 01:42:03.380
I'll take this. Take me out.

01:42:03.422 --> 01:42:04.672
As you wish!

01:42:11.297 --> 01:42:12.922
It's not me.

01:42:12.922 --> 01:42:13.964
It's you.

01:42:14.005 --> 01:42:15.547
It's definitely you.

01:42:16.464 --> 01:42:18.089
Just admit it.

01:42:18.172 --> 01:42:20.589
Just say what you think and
how you feel out loud.

01:42:20.672 --> 01:42:21.922
Be brave!

01:42:22.797 --> 01:42:23.964
Isn't that too mean bitch?

01:42:24.047 --> 01:42:25.464
How can I ever be as mean as you?

01:42:25.505 --> 01:42:28.755
Everyone is evil in your eyes
when you're the true Devil yourself.

01:42:28.839 --> 01:42:32.505
You let your dog poop in front of people's
house but get annoyed at everything.

01:42:32.589 --> 01:42:34.005
How dare you talk to me like that?

01:42:34.214 --> 01:42:36.297
- Do you want me to slap you?
- Do it.

01:42:36.547 --> 01:42:37.630
DO IT!

01:42:43.005 --> 01:42:45.255
- She's so freaking mean.
- Enough!

01:42:45.630 --> 01:42:47.255
Boy, you moving back in?

01:42:47.464 --> 01:42:49.964
No one is renting from you,
I'll move out next month.

01:42:49.964 --> 01:42:51.547
Don't pretend to be a nice person.

01:42:51.672 --> 01:42:53.297
What the heck?

01:42:53.339 --> 01:42:54.380
What did I do?

01:42:54.422 --> 01:42:56.672
What's with all the noise?

01:42:56.797 --> 01:42:58.422
Why are you taking up all the space?

01:42:58.505 --> 01:43:00.964
- Move.
- No, you move! Out of my life!

01:43:01.047 --> 01:43:02.130
Pervert!

01:43:02.672 --> 01:43:04.130
How dare you yell at me?

01:43:06.089 --> 01:43:07.589
You wanna fight again?

01:43:07.630 --> 01:43:08.922
Why did you yell at my husband?

01:43:08.922 --> 01:43:11.714
You're no better than him,
take a look at yourself.

01:43:11.797 --> 01:43:12.797
Stop it.

01:43:13.047 --> 01:43:14.422
No one wants your husband.

01:43:14.630 --> 01:43:16.797
Why do you have to protect such a man?

01:43:16.797 --> 01:43:19.630
Spend that time on
making yourself beautiful instead!

01:43:23.422 --> 01:43:25.672
Fantastic speech, girl!

01:43:26.172 --> 01:43:27.714
Kill them with your words!

01:43:28.672 --> 01:43:30.214
Just be happy!

01:43:54.797 --> 01:43:56.089
Mai Thi Ngoc Mai.

01:43:56.297 --> 01:43:57.672
I love you!

01:43:58.922 --> 01:44:00.297
Le Trung Duong

01:44:00.630 --> 01:44:02.130
Allowed!

01:44:21.422 --> 01:44:22.464
- Sau...
- Yes?

01:44:22.672 --> 01:44:24.339
I wonder what mom called us for.

01:44:25.755 --> 01:44:27.297
Whatever she said

01:44:27.547 --> 01:44:29.255
we've got our own decisions already.

01:44:29.714 --> 01:44:30.797
Right?

01:44:31.422 --> 01:44:32.630
You've got me.

01:44:38.880 --> 01:44:40.255
How's the food?

01:44:46.130 --> 01:44:47.255
There you are.

01:44:47.297 --> 01:44:48.755
Come on in.

01:44:49.089 --> 01:44:50.214
Have a seat.

01:44:53.714 --> 01:44:56.005
- Why are you here?
- Wait and you'll see.

01:44:57.047 --> 01:44:59.172
Tham, serve the food.

01:44:59.214 --> 01:45:00.422
Yes, ma'am.

01:45:01.172 --> 01:45:02.714
Wow, family meeting?

01:45:03.297 --> 01:45:04.547
How have you been recently?

01:45:04.547 --> 01:45:05.630
Good.

01:45:06.047 --> 01:45:07.089
It's steak,

01:45:07.214 --> 01:45:09.005
your favourite food, eat up.

01:45:10.755 --> 01:45:11.880
Have some food, mom.

01:45:12.505 --> 01:45:14.380
You probably didn't call me home

01:45:14.464 --> 01:45:16.630
just for the steak, right?

01:45:18.547 --> 01:45:21.089
Can't I just invite you guys home
for dinner?

01:45:21.464 --> 01:45:22.714
So many questions.

01:45:29.839 --> 01:45:32.880
We were so close, I was having so much fun,

01:45:33.297 --> 01:45:34.630
then this happened,

01:45:34.964 --> 01:45:36.422
we can't even look at each other.

01:45:36.964 --> 01:45:38.130
This is nonsense.

01:45:41.130 --> 01:45:42.380
It's all my fault.

01:45:42.422 --> 01:45:44.172
I've given you so much hope,

01:45:44.172 --> 01:45:46.130
and I was the one to take it all away.

01:45:47.339 --> 01:45:48.797
It seems like

01:45:49.047 --> 01:45:50.339
I'm so selfish.

01:45:51.589 --> 01:45:54.755
That's why I want to
give something back to you.

01:45:55.422 --> 01:45:57.297
Binh Minh loves to study abroad.

01:45:59.714 --> 01:46:01.255
Four years in Switzerland.

01:46:01.339 --> 01:46:02.797
That's all I can do.

01:46:03.380 --> 01:46:05.380
Take it to ease my mind.

01:46:06.380 --> 01:46:07.464
Okay?

01:46:12.130 --> 01:46:14.214
You blew my mind.

01:46:14.880 --> 01:46:16.505
You should've said it from the beginning.

01:46:17.005 --> 01:46:18.339
You know I love you, mom?

01:46:18.380 --> 01:46:19.422
You want this?

01:46:22.297 --> 01:46:23.880
She asked me earlier.

01:46:24.130 --> 01:46:26.172
I love you so much.
I know you know.

01:46:26.630 --> 01:46:28.130
I do, too.

01:46:29.172 --> 01:46:30.297
I...

01:46:30.630 --> 01:46:32.339
Thank you for being so thoughtful.

01:46:34.505 --> 01:46:35.839
Thank you for loving me,

01:46:40.172 --> 01:46:41.339
and loving my daughter.

01:46:44.130 --> 01:46:46.047
I know you love your child,

01:46:48.547 --> 01:46:50.297
I do, too.

01:46:54.755 --> 01:46:57.255
So may I take care of your child's future,

01:46:59.380 --> 01:47:01.755
in exchange for my child's future?

01:47:03.839 --> 01:47:05.047
Is that okay?

01:47:10.839 --> 01:47:12.255
Please break up.

01:47:12.880 --> 01:47:13.922
Okay?

01:47:14.797 --> 01:47:15.964
You tricked me?

01:47:16.422 --> 01:47:17.839
You didn't say that earlier.

01:47:18.922 --> 01:47:20.089
I'm sorry, mom.

01:47:22.839 --> 01:47:23.964
Let's go home.

01:47:24.297 --> 01:47:25.255
Let's go mom.

01:47:25.297 --> 01:47:26.464
Stop right there.

01:47:26.922 --> 01:47:28.630
You can't leave like that.

01:47:29.714 --> 01:47:31.672
Dao, say something.

01:47:31.797 --> 01:47:33.755
We planned this.

01:47:34.005 --> 01:47:35.630
I thought when you called me home,

01:47:35.672 --> 01:47:37.672
you'd say something more reasonable.

01:47:38.089 --> 01:47:40.589
If you called me home to break us up,

01:47:40.630 --> 01:47:42.505
I've already told you no.

01:47:42.505 --> 01:47:44.755
It'd still be a "no" no matter what.

01:47:44.839 --> 01:47:46.547
I tried my best to be nice to you.

01:47:48.255 --> 01:47:50.880
Don't force me to show all the ugly things.

01:47:50.880 --> 01:47:52.880
- Go ahead.
- Do you know who Binh Minh's dad is?

01:47:52.922 --> 01:47:54.005
Mom!

01:47:54.422 --> 01:47:55.714
You went too far.

01:47:56.214 --> 01:47:57.297
Sau!

01:47:59.422 --> 01:48:01.505
You think you know her well?

01:48:04.505 --> 01:48:05.714
Bobby!

01:48:05.755 --> 01:48:07.547
Investigate her for me.

01:48:07.547 --> 01:48:09.172
Whatever the cost is.

01:48:09.172 --> 01:48:12.047
I heard you're from the same
hometown as Mai.

01:48:12.797 --> 01:48:14.922
I'll tell you. Don't tell anyone.

01:48:15.589 --> 01:48:16.714
When we were younger,

01:48:17.005 --> 01:48:18.255
Mai was...

01:48:20.964 --> 01:48:22.464
She was a prostitute.

01:48:24.797 --> 01:48:27.922
She sold her virginity
and got pregnant with Binh Minh.

01:48:30.422 --> 01:48:31.880
Let's go home, mom.

01:48:32.672 --> 01:48:34.547
- Dao!
- Why are you so cruel?

01:48:35.547 --> 01:48:39.589
You made this up to insult her just
because you don't want us to be together?

01:48:39.839 --> 01:48:41.839
Do you need to go this low?

01:48:42.089 --> 01:48:43.964
Why did you need to make this up?

01:48:44.089 --> 01:48:45.214
Who made it up?

01:48:45.464 --> 01:48:47.839
How dare you call your ma a liar?

01:48:48.005 --> 01:48:50.130
Bobby, tell him.

01:48:50.339 --> 01:48:51.422
What the hell do you know?

01:48:51.422 --> 01:48:53.255
He hasn't even said a word.

01:48:53.672 --> 01:48:55.047
Watch your damn mouth.

01:48:55.464 --> 01:48:57.172
- Tell him to come out.
- Let's go mom.

01:48:57.922 --> 01:48:59.047
Mai!

01:49:13.714 --> 01:49:14.755
Dad!

01:49:15.880 --> 01:49:16.964
Dad!

01:49:19.505 --> 01:49:20.589
Sit down.

01:49:25.839 --> 01:49:27.797
Tell them, tell them everything.

01:49:35.547 --> 01:49:38.755
I've told them about your past.

01:49:40.672 --> 01:49:42.505
I thought Duong should know too.

01:49:43.172 --> 01:49:45.547
I think...

01:49:46.005 --> 01:49:48.005
This would be good for you two.

01:49:48.380 --> 01:49:50.005
She's right.

01:49:50.547 --> 01:49:52.547
You two don't have a future together.

01:49:52.547 --> 01:49:55.839
Just return him to his family.

01:49:55.880 --> 01:49:59.047
So he can have a future as they want.

01:49:59.089 --> 01:50:01.214
She promised us a sum of money.

01:50:01.422 --> 01:50:04.672
I get some, you get some,
so does Binh Minh.

01:50:04.714 --> 01:50:06.755
Then we can do whatever we want.

01:50:06.755 --> 01:50:11.089
You can't do anything for him,

01:50:11.130 --> 01:50:13.172
other than disrupting his future.

01:50:13.172 --> 01:50:15.464
Is my daughter gonna be okay
if we drug her?

01:50:15.922 --> 01:50:18.339
What are you worried about?
Might as well make some money.

01:50:18.422 --> 01:50:20.630
Then you can take care of your sick wife.

01:50:20.630 --> 01:50:23.005
Every girl loses it at some point.

01:50:25.172 --> 01:50:26.464
I have no choice.

01:50:28.797 --> 01:50:30.130
We were so poor.

01:50:30.422 --> 01:50:31.922
I was neck deep in debt.

01:50:32.339 --> 01:50:33.797
Your mom was dying.

01:50:34.630 --> 01:50:35.964
You're my daughter,

01:50:36.797 --> 01:50:38.172
you oughta sacrifice for our family.

01:50:39.047 --> 01:50:40.089
Mai!

01:50:40.089 --> 01:50:41.714
What's wrong with you?

01:50:41.714 --> 01:50:42.797
You're fucking crazy!

01:50:44.964 --> 01:50:46.130
I'm sorry.

01:51:01.672 --> 01:51:03.505
We can do whatever we want.

01:51:03.839 --> 01:51:07.005
Give him back to his family
so he can have a future.

01:51:07.172 --> 01:51:08.839
You're holding him down.

01:51:12.255 --> 01:51:15.464
We're not on the same level with him.

01:51:15.547 --> 01:51:17.589
He can't do anything for you either.

01:51:17.714 --> 01:51:19.047
How can you...

01:51:21.214 --> 01:51:23.589
How can you be that bad to me?

01:51:23.630 --> 01:51:25.214
I just want what's best for you.

01:51:25.880 --> 01:51:27.005
What are you doing?

01:51:27.339 --> 01:51:29.255
How can you sell me twice like that?

01:51:29.297 --> 01:51:30.880
- How far is enough?
- Mom!

01:51:31.255 --> 01:51:32.755
- Let me go.
- Mom!

01:51:32.797 --> 01:51:34.797
- It's what good for you.
- And you...

01:51:34.964 --> 01:51:36.880
How can treat me this way?

01:51:36.922 --> 01:51:39.505
How can you hurt my child that much?

01:51:39.505 --> 01:51:40.672
I didn't want to.

01:51:40.880 --> 01:51:43.297
I tried my best to convince you guys.

01:51:43.380 --> 01:51:44.672
Calm down, look at me, calm down.

01:51:44.672 --> 01:51:46.547
I'm okay. I'm okay.

01:51:46.922 --> 01:51:48.380
He told me a long time ago.

01:51:48.422 --> 01:51:50.297
It's okay mom.

01:51:51.297 --> 01:51:53.047
She's old enough, she needs to know.

01:51:53.547 --> 01:51:55.339
I've buried it for so long,

01:51:56.339 --> 01:51:58.130
and you did what?

01:51:58.755 --> 01:51:59.880
You're a father,

01:52:00.297 --> 01:52:01.422
and you're a mother,

01:52:01.630 --> 01:52:03.630
how can you be so cruel to me?

01:52:03.672 --> 01:52:06.714
How can you ask people to love you
when your family is so messy?

01:52:06.755 --> 01:52:08.214
And you have the guts to yell at us?

01:52:08.255 --> 01:52:09.380
Sau!

01:52:09.422 --> 01:52:10.797
Can you see this?

01:52:10.839 --> 01:52:12.297
This is all your fault.

01:52:12.839 --> 01:52:15.005
- I'm so sorry.
- You don't need to.

01:52:15.047 --> 01:52:16.672
Let's go home mom, let's go.

01:52:17.089 --> 01:52:18.339
Let me go.

01:52:18.880 --> 01:52:20.464
It's okay, it's okay.

01:52:21.005 --> 01:52:22.214
I'm right here.

01:52:22.922 --> 01:52:24.714
I'm right here, it's okay.

01:52:25.339 --> 01:52:26.464
Mom,

01:52:26.964 --> 01:52:28.130
Mami,

01:52:28.672 --> 01:52:29.880
sir,

01:52:30.964 --> 01:52:33.130
I don't care what her past is like,

01:52:37.214 --> 01:52:38.505
I just want to marry her.

01:52:39.380 --> 01:52:40.547
What the heck?

01:52:40.547 --> 01:52:43.047
Duong, you're in too deep!
You're insane!

01:52:43.089 --> 01:52:44.464
Just go home to your family.

01:52:44.505 --> 01:52:45.589
I don't need you to.

01:52:45.630 --> 01:52:46.922
Are you even thinking straight?

01:52:47.714 --> 01:52:49.047
You pick that trash

01:52:49.297 --> 01:52:50.630
over your mom?

01:52:50.630 --> 01:52:51.839
What is she to you?

01:52:52.005 --> 01:52:55.464
Do you really want me to remind you that
she's just a fucking masseuse?

01:52:55.464 --> 01:52:56.964
- Enough.
- What's enough?

01:52:57.089 --> 01:53:00.089
She dates you, she can date anyone,
she meets hundreds of dudes every day,

01:53:00.130 --> 01:53:01.547
are you out of your mind?

01:53:01.547 --> 01:53:03.505
You're treating your mom like that
because of her?

01:53:03.589 --> 01:53:04.839
Is she worth it?

01:53:05.130 --> 01:53:06.130
What did you tell me?

01:53:06.172 --> 01:53:08.089
You think she was hot, she was easy,

01:53:08.172 --> 01:53:09.380
- I said enough.
- she was different,

01:53:09.422 --> 01:53:11.797
so you approached her
just to have a fuck for fun.

01:53:12.005 --> 01:53:13.172
- Watch your mouth!
- What the hell!

01:53:13.672 --> 01:53:15.339
Duong, I'm begging you.

01:53:17.839 --> 01:53:18.964
Is that true?

01:53:18.964 --> 01:53:20.922
- Bobby!
- I'm your friend.

01:53:21.964 --> 01:53:23.214
Asshole!

01:53:26.755 --> 01:53:29.297
- Sau!
- Stop fighting!

01:53:29.422 --> 01:53:31.130
Dao, do something.

01:53:31.172 --> 01:53:33.797
Oh my gosh! Duong!

01:53:36.005 --> 01:53:37.172
Duong! Look at your mom!

01:53:38.172 --> 01:53:40.380
Dao! Wake up!

01:53:40.422 --> 01:53:42.547
- Dao!
- Call the ambulance!

01:53:58.089 --> 01:53:59.755
You're acting like I'm fucking you over.

01:54:00.339 --> 01:54:02.047
How can you refuse your future?

01:54:02.047 --> 01:54:03.089
Are you insane?

01:54:07.297 --> 01:54:08.464
I told you I have no choice.

01:54:08.630 --> 01:54:09.755
I really don't.

01:54:10.172 --> 01:54:12.339
I have no way to make money.

01:54:12.505 --> 01:54:14.422
I really really don't.

01:54:15.130 --> 01:54:16.797
What can he do for you?

01:54:17.255 --> 01:54:19.464
You're making me the bad guy
of this family!

01:54:19.839 --> 01:54:21.464
I'm doing what's best for you.

01:54:21.714 --> 01:54:23.255
Everyone gets some money.

01:54:23.547 --> 01:54:26.589
What are you doing?

01:54:26.839 --> 01:54:28.005
Let go of me.

01:54:28.047 --> 01:54:29.130
Mai!

01:54:30.672 --> 01:54:31.797
Mai!

01:54:32.422 --> 01:54:33.755
MAI!

01:54:36.505 --> 01:54:38.047
Are you fucking crazy?

01:55:13.464 --> 01:55:14.672
Mister!

01:55:14.797 --> 01:55:16.005
Hey!

01:55:16.214 --> 01:55:17.339
Everyone!

01:55:17.422 --> 01:55:18.839
Call the ambulance!

01:56:35.797 --> 01:56:36.922
Mai!

01:56:37.214 --> 01:56:38.214
Can we...

01:56:38.214 --> 01:56:40.089
Stop persuading me.

01:56:40.339 --> 01:56:41.922
We've talked this over.

01:56:43.797 --> 01:56:45.422
I'm done being in love.

01:56:47.755 --> 01:56:49.005
I'm tired.

01:56:50.880 --> 01:56:55.922
It'd be really selfish of us to keep being
together when your mom is in that state.

01:56:57.047 --> 01:56:58.839
You're only thirty.

01:56:59.422 --> 01:57:00.755
Your life just started.

01:57:01.297 --> 01:57:02.964
Don't treat your mother even worse

01:57:03.255 --> 01:57:04.714
just because of me.

01:57:07.089 --> 01:57:08.297
I've been thinking

01:57:09.589 --> 01:57:11.089
where did we go wrong?

01:57:13.880 --> 01:57:15.255
We met at the wrong time.

01:57:18.214 --> 01:57:19.339
Mai...

01:57:20.172 --> 01:57:21.380
Give me two years.

01:57:21.839 --> 01:57:24.214
I promise I'll try my best
in that two years.

01:57:24.505 --> 01:57:26.839
When mom gets better, I'll figure us out.

01:57:26.880 --> 01:57:29.047
In that two years,

01:57:29.339 --> 01:57:31.839
if you meet someone,
then I'll be happy.

01:57:32.130 --> 01:57:33.464
But if you don't,

01:57:33.464 --> 01:57:34.714
please wait for me.

01:57:34.755 --> 01:57:36.172
Please, I'm begging you.

01:57:36.214 --> 01:57:37.630
Please!

01:57:37.797 --> 01:57:39.339
Okay? Please.

01:57:41.464 --> 01:57:42.422
Sau...

01:57:42.464 --> 01:57:43.797
Don't be like that.

01:57:45.797 --> 01:57:47.255
Just give me one thing.

01:57:49.339 --> 01:57:50.589
Don't wait for me.

01:57:52.547 --> 01:57:53.589
Don't wait for me.

01:57:54.505 --> 01:57:55.589
Promise me.

01:57:58.505 --> 01:58:00.755
If you do, I won't see you again.

01:58:04.297 --> 01:58:05.380
It's okay.

01:58:05.422 --> 01:58:06.464
Don't cry.

01:58:07.755 --> 01:58:10.630
Why am I the one consoling you now?

01:58:11.089 --> 01:58:12.589
Come on, don't cry.

01:58:21.630 --> 01:58:22.672
Sau...

01:58:23.172 --> 01:58:25.755
Do you know what will come
but will never come?

01:58:26.714 --> 01:58:28.047
It's tomorrow.

01:58:29.214 --> 01:58:31.464
So is my happiness, I think.

01:58:33.714 --> 01:58:35.089
I'm leaving now.

01:58:35.839 --> 01:58:37.339
Please be at peace.

01:58:40.214 --> 01:58:41.464
Thank you,

01:58:43.797 --> 01:58:45.089
for loving me.

01:59:08.880 --> 01:59:11.172
Please get off here for the spa.

01:59:13.297 --> 01:59:14.339
Thank you.

01:59:19.089 --> 01:59:23.380
[4 years later]

01:59:34.714 --> 01:59:35.755
Good morning!

01:59:36.672 --> 01:59:39.547
You're by yourself today?
Has anyone greeted you?

01:59:39.547 --> 01:59:41.380
- All is good.
- Please wait a little bit.

01:59:41.422 --> 01:59:42.422
Thank you.

01:59:42.422 --> 01:59:45.714
Mai, remember you have a meeting with
Mr. The at his homestay.

01:59:45.714 --> 01:59:47.672
I know, I changed, see?

01:59:47.672 --> 01:59:50.922
- You're so pretty.
- You are too!

01:59:54.886 --> 01:59:56.719
Hi! I love your suit!

01:59:56.744 --> 01:59:57.600
Thank you.

01:59:57.625 --> 01:59:58.840
Enjoy!

01:59:59.739 --> 02:00:03.739
- That's a nice new sweater you have on.
- I just got it.

02:00:04.589 --> 02:00:05.630
From the market.

02:00:05.700 --> 02:00:07.703
Here's your coffee.

02:00:07.728 --> 02:00:08.184
Yes.

02:00:08.209 --> 02:00:11.219
And these freshly picked flowers,
so pretty, just like you.

02:00:11.089 --> 02:00:12.297
Is that so?

02:00:19.422 --> 02:00:21.339
This is not working.
Let's switch to Bb.

02:00:24.047 --> 02:00:25.255
Go ahead.

02:00:27.622 --> 02:00:30.038
Hello, how have you been?

02:00:30.005 --> 02:00:32.464
I haven't heard anything
about your new job.

02:00:32.505 --> 02:00:34.922
It's not bad, the space is cute and cozy,

02:00:34.922 --> 02:00:36.172
the pay is good,

02:00:36.505 --> 02:00:38.172
and I get to work with my girlfriend.

02:00:38.247 --> 02:00:39.563
Hello Ms. Mom!

02:00:39.588 --> 02:00:41.727
- Hello Jenny.
- How are you?

02:00:42.008 --> 02:00:43.967
Why are you always so pretty?

02:00:43.992 --> 02:00:45.283
You're pretty, too.

02:00:45.313 --> 02:00:46.980
Did you get skinnier?

02:00:47.005 --> 02:00:49.887
Minh called me fat,
doesn't let me eat much.

02:00:49.912 --> 02:00:51.663
Are you crazy Minh?

02:00:51.688 --> 02:00:52.829
Let her eat.

02:00:52.853 --> 02:00:55.355
Healthy girls are pretty girls.

02:00:55.380 --> 02:00:58.088
You're coming to visit
me on my birthday, right?

02:00:58.177 --> 02:00:59.663
We'll visit you for sure.

02:00:59.688 --> 02:01:01.507
- I'm off now.
- Bye mom.

02:01:01.532 --> 02:01:03.337
Ok. Bye.

02:01:11.647 --> 02:01:12.515
I'm heading out.

02:01:19.036 --> 02:01:20.304
Thank you Boss.

02:01:20.329 --> 02:01:21.663
You're very good at your job.

02:01:21.688 --> 02:01:23.313
I have many more homestays in Dalat.

02:01:23.480 --> 02:01:25.480
Excel on this three year contract,

02:01:25.505 --> 02:01:27.005
and I'll give you the rest.

02:01:27.961 --> 02:01:29.253
That's a deal!

02:01:29.563 --> 02:01:31.397
Here's the contract.
Please excuse me.

02:01:31.397 --> 02:01:32.068
Thank you.

02:01:32.093 --> 02:01:32.700
Yes.

02:01:34.841 --> 02:01:35.879
See you later.

02:01:42.772 --> 02:01:43.588
Mai!

02:02:26.253 --> 02:02:27.331
Come on,

02:02:27.782 --> 02:02:28.824
stop crying.

02:02:31.003 --> 02:02:32.586
People are gonna see you.

02:02:34.131 --> 02:02:36.089
Still a crybaby?

02:02:37.313 --> 02:02:38.647
Come on...

02:02:39.253 --> 02:02:40.378
How have you been?

02:02:41.742 --> 02:02:42.784
I'm good.

02:02:43.029 --> 02:02:44.154
I have a great job.

02:02:45.007 --> 02:02:47.098
I... I live here now.

02:02:48.061 --> 02:02:49.269
What are you doing here?

02:02:49.740 --> 02:02:50.641
Honey!

02:02:51.448 --> 02:02:54.202
You don't even wait for me and mom?

02:02:55.560 --> 02:02:56.876
Crying?

02:02:56.901 --> 02:02:57.580
Nope.

02:02:58.355 --> 02:02:59.813
- Hello.
- Hi.

02:02:59.855 --> 02:03:01.230
You are...

02:03:01.631 --> 02:03:04.521
I'm Duong's friend, from piano class.

02:03:04.687 --> 02:03:06.553
Why are you crying?

02:03:06.678 --> 02:03:07.678
Runny nose?

02:03:07.725 --> 02:03:10.080
It's not that, it was because

02:03:10.105 --> 02:03:11.605
when I was in class, I was so sick that

02:03:11.630 --> 02:03:15.783
he thought I was dead, turns out
I'm still here, so those are happy tears.

02:03:15.993 --> 02:03:17.355
Bravo!

02:03:17.380 --> 02:03:19.596
- Vy! Vy!
- Yes mom.

02:03:19.621 --> 02:03:22.493
So many flowers for us to put in the room.

02:03:22.518 --> 02:03:23.345
Yes.

02:03:27.178 --> 02:03:29.214
Take it slow mom.

02:03:39.639 --> 02:03:40.889
How have you been?

02:03:44.819 --> 02:03:45.743
And you?

02:03:46.342 --> 02:03:48.900
- I'm good.
- You know each other?

02:03:49.621 --> 02:03:50.788
You guys are staying here?

02:03:50.813 --> 02:03:54.524
We're on vacation to
celebrate our little baby boy.

02:03:55.339 --> 02:03:56.672
Congratulations!

02:03:56.772 --> 02:04:00.105
You guys talk,
I'll take mom to check in.

02:04:00.130 --> 02:04:01.355
Walk slowly.

02:04:01.380 --> 02:04:02.817
Take your time to catch up.

02:04:02.841 --> 02:04:03.929
Let me take care of mom.

02:04:04.404 --> 02:04:06.654
Enjoy! No need to rush!

02:04:06.938 --> 02:04:07.980
Let's go, mom.

02:04:08.803 --> 02:04:11.219
Oh my gosh she's so pretty.

02:04:11.244 --> 02:04:12.661
And elegant.

02:04:12.863 --> 02:04:15.833
I'll copy her make-up style.

02:04:16.017 --> 02:04:16.692
Sis!

02:04:16.717 --> 02:04:18.258
Your wife is so cute!

02:04:18.451 --> 02:04:20.748
Yes, she is.

02:04:21.389 --> 02:04:22.444
Very care-free.

02:04:23.523 --> 02:04:25.299
How are you though?

02:04:25.682 --> 02:04:26.765
Are you dating someone?

02:04:26.822 --> 02:04:28.072
Of course.

02:04:28.514 --> 02:04:30.024
I'm still hot.

02:04:31.970 --> 02:04:32.837
Uh.

02:04:37.092 --> 02:04:38.550
Speak of the devil.

02:04:39.131 --> 02:04:40.391
Just a moment please.

02:04:41.623 --> 02:04:42.433
What do you think?

02:04:42.790 --> 02:04:43.832
Hotter than you?

02:04:44.631 --> 02:04:45.631
Nice guy.

02:04:46.272 --> 02:04:47.480
- Mai.
- Yes?

02:04:48.818 --> 02:04:50.568
- Can we...
- No no no.

02:04:51.093 --> 02:04:53.550
Being friends? Don't think about it.

02:04:54.034 --> 02:04:55.242
You are

02:04:56.308 --> 02:04:58.141
a husband and a father now.

02:04:58.537 --> 02:04:59.454
Grow up.

02:04:59.951 --> 02:05:01.751
You're too childish sometimes.

02:05:03.855 --> 02:05:05.605
I'm so happy for you.

02:05:07.480 --> 02:05:10.272
See? No one dies from missing someone.

02:05:11.195 --> 02:05:12.320
Be your best.

02:05:13.030 --> 02:05:14.571
Join them, I'll head out.

02:05:17.975 --> 02:05:18.760
Sau!

02:05:20.086 --> 02:05:21.063
Thank you.

02:05:21.511 --> 02:05:22.618
For what?

02:05:23.691 --> 02:05:24.941
For not waiting for me.

02:05:26.909 --> 02:05:28.034
Piano classmate!

02:05:32.382 --> 02:05:33.548
Be happy!

02:05:40.946 --> 02:05:43.663
- You're not sitting in the back, boss?
- I'm fine sitting here.

02:05:43.688 --> 02:05:44.813
- Ok.
- Hold on.

02:05:49.021 --> 02:05:50.104
Head inside.

02:05:51.780 --> 02:05:53.274
Honey, our room is ready.

02:06:07.147 --> 02:06:08.638
Is that Mai's boyfriend?
